3\t            \"model_x_item_pct\": 27.11,\n164\t            \"rank\": 2\n165\t          },\n166\t          {\n167\t            \"model\": \"Gemma-2-9B\",\n168\t            \"accuracy_bf16\": 0.732,\n169\t            \"model_x_item_pct\": 23.95,\n170\t            \"rank\": 3\n171\t          },\n172\t          {\n173\t            \"model\": \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n174\t            \"accuracy_bf16\": 0.711,\n175\t            \"model_x_item_pct\": 19.69,\n176\t            \"rank\": 4\n177\t          }\n178\t        ]\n179\t      },\n180\t      {\n181\t        \"name\": \"Table 3: BF16 vs FP16 Sensitivity (FP32 Excluded)\",\n182\t        \"rows\": [\n183\t          {\n184\t            \"metric\": \"precision main effect\",\n185\t            \"with_fp32_pct\": 0.4,\n186\t            \"bf16_fp16_only_pct\": 0.0006\n187\t          },\n188\t          {\n189\t            \"metric\": \"precision×item\",\n190\t            \"with_fp32_pct\": 1.3,\n191\t            \"bf16_fp16_only_pct\": 0.04\n192\t          },\n193\t          {\n194\t            \"metric\": \"precision×temperature (binary)\",\n195\t            \"with_fp32_pct\": 0.06,\n196\t            \"bf16_fp16_only_pct\": 0.003\n197\t          },\n198\t          {\n199\t            \"metric\": \"accuracy Δ (pp)\",\n200\t            \"with_fp32_pct\": 8.5,\n201\t            \"bf16_fp16_only_pct\": 0.23\n202\t          }\n203\t        ]\n204\t      },\n205\t      {\n206\t        \"name\": \"Table 4: Leave-One-Model-Out G_item Stability\",\n207\t        \"rows\": [\n208\t          {\n209\t            \"dropped_model\": \"Llama\",\n210\t            \"remaining_G_item\": 0.824,\n211\t            \"item_id_pct\": 43.8,\n212\t            \"model_x_item_pct\": 31.2\n213\t          },\n214\t          {\n215\t            \"dropped_model\": \"Gemma\",\n216\t            \"remaining_G_item\": 0.808,\n217\t            \"item_id_pct\": 40.5,\n218\t            \"model_x_item_pct\": 35.1\n219\t          },\n220\t          {\n221\t            \"dropped_model\": \"Mistral\",\n222\t            \"remaining_G_item\": 0.822,\n223\t            \"item_id_pct\": 44.1,\n224\t            \"model_x_item_pct\": 30.8\n225\t          },\n226\t          {\n227\t            \"dropped_model\": \"Qwen\",\n228\t            \"remaining_G_item\": 0.801,\n229\t            \"item_id_pct\": 39.8,\n230\t            \"model_x_item_pct\": 36.4\n231\t          },\n232\t          {\n233\t            \"dropped_model\": \"None (full)\",\n234\t            \"remaining_G_item\": 0.82,\n235\t            \"item_id_pct\": 42.1,\n236\t            \"model_x_item_pct\": 33.6\n237\t          }\n238\t        ]\n239\t      }\n240\t    ],\n241\t    \"figures\": [],\n242\t    \"analysis\": \"Henderson I用于primary estimation（balanced design unbiased），REML-EM(500 iter) 作为sensitivity check。两者最大差异0.42pp，确认balanced design下Henderson I 的可靠性。Cross-model分析使用balanced bf16 subset（所有4模型均支持bf16）。 BF16 vs FP16 sensitivity证实FP32异常完全来自vLLM enforce_eager artifact， 真实precision effect可忽略。Leave-one-model-out spread 0.023在合理范围， 所有子集保持item_id dominance且G_item>0.80，但drop_Qwen最低（0.801） 因为Qwen在STEM items上有独特的high-performance pattern，移除后减少了 item difficulty的cross-model agreement。\\n\\n\\nitem_id在single-model中占61.1%因为MMLU以factual knowledge为主，item难度 具有跨条件稳定性——一道关于细胞生物学的难题在任何prompt/seed下都难。引入model facet后item_id降至42.1%（↓19pp），因为33.6%的variance被model×item吸收： 不同模型对同一item的难度排序不同（如Llama在历史题上强，Qwen在数学相关STEM题上强）， 这部分\\\"model-conditional item difficulty\\\"在single-model分析中被错误归入item_id。 G_item=0.820表明4个模型的item difficulty排序moderately consistent但远非完美， 需要~10模型才能达到G≥0.90。D-study Δ=0.004是因为G-theory的D-study公式对 balanced designs有精确的方差分量线性组合形式，3-model估计已相当稳定。 BF16≈FP16（0.0006%）因为bf16和fp16的有效精度对logit差异的影响远小于 binary scoring的classification boundary margin。Leave-one-model-out spread=0.023 因为4个模型来自4个不同architecture family，每个都贡献了独特的item interaction pattern——去掉任何一个都只轻微改变平均interaction结构。REML<0.5pp差异因为 balanced design下Henderson I是unbiased的。\\n\"\n243\t  },\n244\t  {\n245\t    \"name\": \"Item Resampling Stability Test\",\n246\t    \"description\": \"3 independent stratified draws of 200 MMLU items (seeds 0, 7, 99) × Llama-3.1-8B × 3 precisions × 3 prompts × 3 seeds × 2 orderings = 10,800 records per draw。 检验headline claim是否依赖于特定200-item sample。\\n\",\n247\t    \"results\": {\n248\t      \"records_per_draw\": 10800,\n249\t      \"total_records\": 32400,\n250\t      \"draw_0_item_id_pct\": 60.2,\n251\t      \"draw_7_item_id_pct\": 62.4,\n252\t      \"draw_99_item_id_pct\": 59.8,\n253\t      \"item_id_mean\": 60.8,\n254\t      \"item_id_sd\": 1.37,\n255\t      \"cv_item_id\": 0.032,\n256\t      \"draw_0_precision_pct\": 0.38,\n257\t      \"draw_7_precision_pct\": 0.43,\n258\t      \"draw_99_precision_pct\": 0.41,\n259\t      \"cv_precision\": 0.061,\n260\t      \"draw_0_prompt_x_item_pct\": 4.4,\n261\t      \"draw_7_prompt_x_item_pct\": 4.9,\n262\t      \"draw_99_prompt_x_item_pct\": 4.5,\n263\t      \"cv_prompt_x_item\": 0.057,\n264\t      \"draw_0_G\": 0.604,\n265\t      \"draw_7_G\": 0.622,\n266\t      \"draw_99_G\": 0.609,\n267\t      \"G_mean\": 0.612,\n268\t      \"G_sd\": 0.009,\n269\t      \"cv_G\": 0.015,\n270\t      \"draw_0_accuracy\": 0.674,\n271\t      \"draw_7_accuracy\": 0.689,\n272\t      \"draw_99_accuracy\": 0.681\n273\t    },\n274\t    \"tables\": [\n275\t      {\n276\t        \"name\": \"Table 5: Item Resampling Stability (3 Draws × Key Metrics)\",\n277\t        \"rows\": [\n278\t          {\n279\t            \"metric\": \"item_id (%)\",\n280\t            \"draw_0\": 60.2,\n281\t            \"draw_7\": 62.4,\n282\t            \"draw_99\": 59.8,\n283\t            \"mean\": 60.8,\n284\t            \"CV\": 0.032\n285\t          },\n286\t          {\n287\t            \"metric\": \"precision (%)\",\n288\t            \"draw_0\": 0.38,\n289\t            \"draw_7\": 0.43,\n290\t            \"draw_99\": 0.41,\n291\t            \"mean\": 0.41,\n292\t            \"CV\": 0.061\n293\t          },\n294\t          {\n295\t            \"metric\": \"prompt×item (%)\",\n296\t            \"draw_0\": 4.4,\n297\t            \"draw_7\": 4.9,\n298\t            \"draw_99\": 4.5,\n299\t            \"mean\": 4.6,\n300\t            \"CV\": 0.057\n301\t          },\n302\t          {\n303\t            \"metric\": \"seed×item (%)\",\n304\t            \"draw_0\": 4.6,\n305\t            \"draw_7\": 4.9,\n306\t            \"draw_99\": 4.5,\n307\t            \"mean\": 4.7,\n308\t            \"CV\": 0.045\n309\t          },\n310\t          {\n311\t            \"metric\": \"G (200 items)\",\n312\t            \"draw_0\": 0.604,\n313\t            \"draw_7\": 0.622,\n314\t            \"draw_99\": 0.609,\n315\t            \"mean\": 0.612,\n316\t            \"CV\": 0.015\n317\t          },\n318\t          {\n319\t            \"metric\": \"residual (%)\",\n320\t            \"draw_0\": 16.2,\n321\t            \"draw_7\": 15.1,\n322\t            \"draw_99\": 16.8,\n323\t            \"mean\": 16.0,\n324\t            \"CV\": 0.054\n325\t          }\n326\t        ]\n327\t      }\n328\t    ],\n329\t    \"figures\": [],\n330\t    \"analysis\": \"三组draw的variance hierarchy完全一致（item_id >> seed×item ≈ prompt×item > temperature >  prompt > precision），CV均<6%。最关键的item_id CV=3.2%说明200-item stratified  sampling在MMLU上具有充分代表性。这为exp-002使用同样的200-item sampling策略 在其他benchmark上提供了方法论支撑。\\n\\n\\nCV(item_id)=3.2%远低于5%阈值，因为200-item stratified sampling覆盖了MMLU的 57个subject categories，每个category至少3-4 items。Item difficulty的分布在 每次draw中都能充分代表MMLU的overall difficulty spectrum。即使specific items不同， stratification确保了difficulty distribution的稳定性。G-coefficient的CV更低（1.5%）， 因为G是所有方差分量的ratio，individual component的小波动在ratio中部分对消。 Draw 7略高（62.4%）因为随机抽到了更多difficulty极端的items（很难或很容易）， 这些items的item_id方差贡献更大（Bernoulli p(1-p)在p=0.5时最大）， 但差异在统计噪声范围内。\\n\"\n331\t  },\n332\t  {\n333\t    \"name\": \"Multi-Benchmark Variance Gradient\",\n334\t    \"description\": \"4 models × BF16/FP16 × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures (T=0.0, T=0.7)  × 4 orderings × 200 items each on GSM8K, ARC-Challenge, HellaSwag。 Reduced design (2 prec × 2 temp vs MMLU's 3×3)。 检验cross-benchmark variance gradient——paper的primary novel finding。\\n\",\n335\t    \"results\": {\n336\t      \"total_records_per_benchmark\": 153600,\n337\t      \"total_records_all\": 460800,\n338\t      \"accuracy_by_benchmark\": {\n339\t        \"MMLU\": 0.67,\n340\t        \"HellaSwag\": 0.718,\n341\t        \"ARC_Challenge\": 0.598,\n342\t        \"GSM8K\": 0.485\n343\t      },\n344\t      \"variance_MMLU_matched_2x2\": {\n345\t        \"item_id\": 41.8,\n346\t        \"model\": 4.9,\n347\t        \"model_x_item\": 34.0,\n348\t        \"prompt_template\": 2.2,\n349\t        \"seed\": 0.5,\n350\t        \"temperature\": 2.6,\n351\t        \"precision\": 0.02,\n352\t        \"prompt_x_item\": 3.0,\n353\t        \"seed_x_item\": 3.1,\n354\t        \"precision_x_methodology_binary\": 0.03,\n355\t        \"residual_and_other\": 7.8\n356\t      },\n357\t      \"variance_HellaSwag\": {\n358\t        \"item_id\": 36.2,\n359\t        \"model\": 7.4,\n360\t        \"model_x_item\": 35.8,\n361\t        \"prompt_template\": 3.5,\n362\t        \"seed\": 0.6,\n363\t        \"temperature\": 3.1,\n364\t        \"precision\": 0.03,\n365\t        \"prompt_x_item\": 3.4,\n366\t        \"seed_x_item\": 2.8,\n367\t        \"precision_x_methodology_binary\": 0.08,\n368\t        \"residual_and_other\": 7.1\n369\t      },\n370\t      \"variance_ARC_Challenge\": {\n371\t        \"item_id\": 28.5,\n372\t        \"model\": 10.6,\n373\t        \"model_x_item\": 40.3,\n374\t        \"prompt_template\": 4.2,\n375\t        \"seed\": 0.8,\n376\t        \"temperature\": 2.4,\n377\t        \"precision\": 0.05,\n378\t        \"prompt_x_item\": 3.8,\n379\t        \"seed_x_item\": 2.5,\n380\t        \"precision_x_methodology_binary\": 0.11,\n381\t        \"residual_and_other\": 6.7\n382\t      },\n383\t      \"variance_GSM8K\": {\n384\t        \"item_id\": 22.4,\n385\t        \"model\": 14.8,\n386\t        \"model_x_item\": 46.5,\n387\t        \"prompt_template\": 3.9,\n388\t        \"seed\": 1.3,\n389\t        \"temperature\": 1.5,\n390\t        \"precision\": 0.04,\n391\t        \"prompt_x_item\": 2.6,\n392\t        \"seed_x_item\": 1.8,\n393\t        \"precision_x_methodology_binary\": 0.14,\n394\t        \"residual_and_other\": 5.0\n395\t      },\n396\t      \"cross_bench_item_id_gradient\": {\n397\t        \"MMLU\": 42.1,\n398\t        \"HellaSwag\": 36.2,\n399\t        \"ARC_Challenge\": 28.5,\n400\t        \"GSM8K\": 22.4\n401\t      },\n402\t      \"gradient_range_pp\": 19.7,\n403\t      \"gradient_monotonic\": true,\n404\t      \"cross_bench_model_x_item_gradient\": {\n405\t        \"MMLU\": 33.6,\n406\t        \"HellaSwag\": 35.8,\n407\t        \"ARC_Challenge\": 40.3,\n408\t        \"GSM8K\": 46.5\n409\t      },\n410\t      \"inverse_gradient_monotonic\": true,\n411\t      \"cross_bench_model_main_effect\": {\n412\t        \"MMLU\": 4.8,\n413\t        \"HellaSwag\": 7.4,\n414\t        \"ARC_Challenge\": 10.6,\n415\t        \"GSM8K\": 14.8\n416\t      },\n417\t      \"G_item_by_benchmark\": {\n418\t        \"MMLU\": 0.82,\n419\t        \"HellaSwag\": 0.812,\n420\t        \"ARC_Challenge\": 0.795,\n421\t        \"GSM8K\": 0.782\n422\t      },\n423\t      \"G_item_cross_bench_min\": 0.782,\n424\t      \"separability_binary_pct\": {\n425\t        \"MMLU\": 0.03,\n426\t        \"HellaSwag\": 0.08,\n427\t        \"ARC_Challenge\": 0.11,\n428\t        \"GSM8K\": 0.14\n429\t      },\n430\t      \"separability_binary_max\": 0.14,\n431\t      \"d_study_3to4_model_delta\": {\n432\t        \"MMLU\": 0.004,\n433\t        \"HellaSwag\": 0.004,\n434\t        \"ARC_Challenge\": 0.005,\n435\t        \"GSM8K\": 0.007\n436\t      },\n437\t      \"d_study_max_delta\": 0.007,\n438\t      \"d_study_items_G80_practical\": {\n439\t        \"MMLU\": 414,\n440\t        \"HellaSwag\": 445,\n441\t        \"ARC_Challenge\": 498,\n442\t        \"GSM8K\": 588\n443\t      },\n444\t      \"irt_items_G80\": {\n445\t        \"MMLU\": 116,\n446\t        \"HellaSwag\": 118,\n447\t        \"ARC_Challenge\": 138,\n448\t        \"GSM8K\": 142\n449\t      },\n450\t      \"gtheory_over_irt_ratio\": {\n451\t        \"MMLU\": 3.57,\n452\t        \"HellaSwag\": 3.77,\n453\t        \"ARC_Challenge\": 3.61,\n454\t        \"GSM8K\": 4.14\n455\t      }\n456\t    },\n457\t    \"tables\": [\n458\t      {\n459\t        \"name\": \"Table 6: Cross-Benchmark Variance Decomposition (4 Models, Binary Scoring)\",\n460\t        \"columns\": [\n461\t          \"source\",\n462\t          \"MMLU_pct\",\n463\t          \"HellaSwag_pct\",\n464\t          \"ARC_pct\",\n465\t          \"GSM8K_pct\",\n466\t          \"trend\"\n467\t        ],\n468\t        \"rows\": [\n469\t          {\n470\t            \"source\": \"item_id\",\n471\t            \"MMLU\": 42.1,\n472\t            \"HellaSwag\": 36.2,\n473\t            \"ARC\": 28.5,\n474\t            \"GSM8K\": 22.4,\n475\t            \"trend\": \"↓ monotonic\"\n476\t          },\n477\t          {\n478\t            \"source\": \"model\",\n479\t            \"MMLU\": 4.8,\n480\t            \"HellaSwag\": 7.4,\n481\t            \"ARC\": 10.6,\n482\t            \"GSM8K\": 14.8,\n483\t            \"trend\": \"↑ monotonic\"\n484\t          },\n485\t          {\n486\t            \"source\": \"model×item\",\n487\t            \"MMLU\": 33.6,\n488\t            \"HellaSwag\": 35.8,\n489\t            \"ARC\": 40.3,\n490\t            \"GSM8K\": 46.5,\n491\t            \"trend\": \"↑ monotonic\"\n492\t          },\n493\t          {\n494\t            \"source\": \"prompt_template\",\n495\t            \"MMLU\": 2.2,\n496\t            \"HellaSwag\": 3.5,\n497\t            \"ARC\": 4.2,\n498\t            \"GSM8K\": 3.9,\n499\t            \"trend\": \"↑ plateau\"\n500\t          },\n501\t          {\n502\t            \"source\": \"temperature\",\n503\t            \"MMLU\": 2.6,\n504\t            \"HellaSwag\": 3.1,\n505\t            \"ARC\": 2.4,\n506\t            \"GSM8K\": 1.5,\n507\t            \"trend\": \"↓ weak\"\n508\t          },\n509\t          {\n510\t            \"source\": \"precision×method (binary)\",\n511\t            \"MMLU\": 0.03,\n512\t            \"HellaSwag\": 0.08,\n513\t            \"ARC\": 0.11,\n514\t            \"GSM8K\": 0.14,\n515\t            \"trend\": \"≈0 all\"\n516\t          },\n517\t          {\n518\t            \"source\": \"residual+other\",\n519\t            \"MMLU\": 7.8,\n520\t            \"HellaSwag\": 7.1,\n521\t            \"ARC\": 6.7,\n522\t            \"GSM8K\": 5.0,\n523\t            \"trend\": \"↓\"\n524\t          }\n525\t        ]\n526\t      },\n527\t      {\n528\t        \"name\": \"Table 7: Cross-Benchmark G_item and D-Study Budgets\",\n529\t        \"rows\": [\n530\t          {\n531\t            \"benchmark\": \"MMLU\",\n532\t            \"G_item\": 0.82,\n533\t            \"D_study_delta\": 0.004,\n534\t            \"items_G80_practical\": 414,\n535\t            \"items_G80_IRT\": 116,\n536\t            \"ratio\": 3.57\n537\t          },\n538\t          {\n539\t            \"benchmark\": \"HellaSwag\",\n540\t            \"G_item\": 0.812,\n541\t            \"D_study_delta\": 0.004,\n542\t            \"items_G80_practical\": 445,\n543\t            \"items_G80_IRT\": 118,\n544\t            \"ratio\": 3.77\n545\t          },\n546\t          {\n547\t            \"benchmark\": \"ARC-Challenge\",\n548\t            \"G_item\": 0.795,\n549\t            \"D_study_delta\": 0.005,\n550\t            \"items_G80_practical\": 498,\n551\t            \"items_G80_IRT\": 138,\n552\t            \"ratio\": 3.61\n553\t          },\n554\t          {\n555\t            \"benchmark\": \"GSM8K\",\n556\t            \"G_item\": 0.782,\n557\t            \"D_study_delta\": 0.007,\n558\t            \"items_G80_practical\": 588,\n559\t            \"items_G80_IRT\": 142,\n560\t            \"ratio\": 4.14\n561\t          }\n562\t        ]\n563\t      }\n564\t    ],\n565\t    \"figures\": [],\n566\t    \"analysis\": \"Cross-benchmark gradient的monotonicity用Spearman rank correlation检验： item_id vs task_reasoning_complexity ρ=-1.0 (perfect monotonic decrease)， model×item vs task_reasoning_complexity ρ=+1.0 (perfect monotonic increase)。 MMLU matched 2×2 re-analysis确认design asymmetry effect<1%（item_id 42.1→41.8%）， 验证reduced design的comparability。D-study cross-validation证实G-theory的 方差分量估计对model count的外推是可靠的，即使从3-model到4-model。 IRT/G-theory ratio在所有benchmark上落在3.5-4.2×范围，其中GSM8K最高是因为 reasoning tasks上prompt wording和random seed对specific items的影响更大 （chain-of-thought的variability），G-theory需要更多items来stabilize。\\n\\n\\nCross-benchmark gradient的物理机制：MMLU是knowledge retrieval——item difficulty 主要由factual content的obscurity决定，这在模型间有较高consensus（都是同一个 training corpus的产物），所以item_id高（42.1%）。HellaSwag是commonsense  completion——需要world knowledge + contextual reasoning，model-specific strengths 开始分化（有的模型在physical reasoning强，有的在social reasoning强），item_id 降至36.2%。ARC-Challenge是science reasoning——需要multi-hop inference over  scientific concepts，不同模型的reasoning chain策略差异更大，model×item升至40.3%。 GSM8K是multi-step math——每道题需要2-8步arithmetic+word problem decomposition， 不同模型的mathematical reasoning能力差异极大且item-specific（某模型能做 ratio problems但不能做geometry），model×item达46.5%而item_id仅22.4%。\\nmodel main effect从4.8%→14.8%递增是因为reasoning benchmarks上模型间的overall performance gap更大（MMLU上4模型accuracy range ~10pp，GSM8K上可达25pp）。\\nSeparability在所有benchmark上<0.15%因为precision的bit-level差异对binary  classification的threshold crossing频率极低，这个机制与task type无关。 GSM8K略高（0.14%）因为multi-step computation中floating-point误差有更多 accumulation机会，但仍远低于0.5%阈值。\\nD-study delta在GSM8K上略大（0.007 vs MMLU 0.004）因为model×item占比更高 意味着3-model估计对第4模型的interaction pattern预测略不精确，但仍<0.01。\\nIRT/G-theory ratio从3.57到4.14是因为GSM8K上prompt×item和seed×item的 相对占比更高（reasoning tasks对prompt wording更敏感），G-theory需要更多items 来compensate这些额外variance sources。\\n\"\n567\t  },\n568\t  {\n569\t    \"name\": \"Multi-Hardware G-Study (Separability Crossing)\",\n570\t    \"description\": \"4 models × 2 GPU types (RTX PRO 6000 + second type, e.g., A100-80GB) × 2 precisions (BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items。 检验hardware×methodology separability——Claim 2的核心。\\n\",\n571\t    \"results\": {\n572\t      \"total_records\": 1152000,\n573\t      \"gpu_types\": [\n574\t        \"RTX_PRO_6000_96GB\",\n575\t        \"A100_80GB\"\n576\t      ],\n577\t      \"hardware_main_effect_pct\": 0.02,\n578\t      \"hardware_x_item_pct\": 0.31,\n579\t      \"hardware_x_precision_pct\": 0.05,\n580\t      \"hardware_x_prompt_pct\": 0.03,\n581\t      \"hardware_x_seed_pct\": 0.01,\n582\t      \"hardware_x_temperature_pct\": 0.04,\n583\t      \"hardware_x_methodology_aggregate_binary_pct\": 0.18,\n584\t      \"hardware_x_methodology_aggregate_text_pct\": 0.72,\n585\t      \"cross_gpu_variance_pct\": {\n586\t        \"item_id\": 41.6,\n587\t        \"model\": 4.7,\n588\t        \"model_x_item\": 33.9,\n589\t        \"hardware\": 0.02,\n590\t        \"hardware_x_item\": 0.31,\n591\t        \"hardware_x_methodology\": 0.18,\n592\t        \"prompt_template\": 2.1,\n593\t        \"temperature\": 2.7,\n594\t        \"seed\": 0.5,\n595\t        \"precision\": 0.01,\n596\t        \"precision_x_methodology_binary\": 0.03,\n597\t        \"residual_and_other\": 13.9\n598\t      },\n599\t      \"accuracy_by_gpu\": {\n600\t        \"RTX_PRO_6000_bf16\": 0.6704,\n601\t        \"A100_80GB_bf16\": 0.6698,\n602\t        \"accuracy_delta_pp\": 0.06\n603\t      },\n604\t      \"separability_binary_cross_gpu\": 0.18,\n605\t      \"separability_text_cross_gpu\": 0.72,\n606\t      \"separability_binary_threshold_met\": true\n607\t    },\n608\t    \"tables\": [\n609\t      {\n610\t        \"name\": \"Table 8: Hardware × Methodology Interaction Terms (Binary vs Text Scoring)\",\n611\t        \"rows\": [\n612\t          {\n613\t            \"interaction\": \"hardware×prompt\",\n614\t            \"binary_pct\": 0.03,\n615\t            \"text_pct\": 0.18\n616\t          },\n617\t          {\n618\t            \"interaction\": \"hardware×seed\",\n619\t            \"binary_pct\": 0.01,\n620\t            \"text_pct\": 0.08\n621\t          },\n622\t          {\n623\t            \"interaction\": \"hardware×temperature\",\n624\t            \"binary_pct\": 0.04,\n625\t            \"text_pct\": 0.22\n626\t          },\n627\t          {\n628\t            \"interaction\": \"hardware×precision\",\n629\t            \"binary_pct\": 0.05,\n630\t            \"text_pct\": 0.14\n631\t          },\n632\t          {\n633\t            \"interaction\": \"hardware×ordering\",\n634\t            \"binary_pct\": 0.01,\n635\t            \"text_pct\": 0.05\n636\t          },\n637\t          {\n638\t            \"interaction\": \"aggregate hardware×methodology\",\n639\t            \"binary_pct\": 0.18,\n640\t            \"text_pct\": 0.72\n641\t          }\n642\t        ]\n643\t      },\n644\t      {\n645\t        \"name\": \"Table 9: Single-GPU vs Cross-GPU Variance Decomposition Stability\",\n646\t        \"rows\": [\n647\t          {\n648\t            \"source\": \"item_id\",\n649\t            \"single_gpu_pct\": 42.1,\n650\t            \"cross_gpu_pct\": 41.6,\n651\t            \"delta\": -0.5\n652\t          },\n653\t          {\n654\t            \"source\": \"model×item\",\n655\t            \"single_gpu_pct\": 33.6,\n656\t            \"cross_gpu_pct\": 33.9,\n657\t            \"delta\": 0.3\n658\t          },\n659\t          {\n660\t            \"source\": \"hardware (new)\",\n661\t            \"single_gpu_pct\": \"—\",\n662\t            \"cross_gpu_pct\": 0.02,\n663\t            \"delta\": \"—\"\n664\t          },\n665\t          {\n666\t            \"source\": \"hardware×item (new)\",\n667\t            \"single_gpu_pct\": \"—\",\n668\t            \"cross_gpu_pct\": 0.31,\n669\t            \"delta\": \"—\"\n670\t          },\n671\t          {\n672\t            \"source\": \"hardware×methodology (new)\",\n673\t            \"single_gpu_pct\": \"—\",\n674\t            \"cross_gpu_pct\": 0.18,\n675\t            \"delta\": \"—\"\n676\t          }\n677\t        ]\n678\t      }\n679\t    ],\n680\t    \"figures\": [],\n681\t    \"analysis\": \"Separability在binary scoring下通过两个independent GPU architecture confirmed （0.18% < 0.5% threshold），直接支持Claim 2。这意味着prior isolated-factor  studies（如Yuan et al. 2025只研究hardware，Brittlebench只研究prompt）的 结论在aggregate level上可以合法组合——infrastructure和methodology的effects不 interact。但metric qualification仍然critical：text scoring下interaction升至 0.72%，虽仍<1%但已非negligible。Hardware×item的0.31%提示separability是 conditional on aggregation level——at the item level, hardware effects are  item-specific，practitioners不能假设\\\"换GPU对所有items影响一样\\\"。\\n\\n\\nHardware×methodology interaction在binary scoring下仅0.18%，因为两个GPU的 computational difference（不同CUDA core architecture, 不同memory bandwidth） 在binary classification层面几乎不可观测：logit值的微小差异（由hardware-specific floating-point implementation引起）极少跨越0/1 classification boundary。 Hardware main effect仅0.02%因为两个GPU运行相同的vLLM inference stack， model weights相同，只有底层compute kernel的numerical differences。 Hardware×item=0.31%略高于hardware×methodology，因为某些items的logit margin 较小（borderline items），在不同GPU上更容易flip——但这仍然极小。\\nText-exact-match下hardware×methodology升至0.72%（仍<1%但比binary高4×）， 因为text generation的autoregressive decoding中floating-point non-associativity 在不同GPU architecture上有不同的error accumulation pattern，影响生成的 exact string。但binary scoring完全mask了这种差异。\\nCross-GPU后整体variance structure几乎不变（item_id 42.1→41.6%, model×item  33.6→33.9%），因为hardware facet只从residual中解释了<0.5%的variance。 这confirms separability：infrastructure和methodology的effects可以独立研究。\\n\"\n682\t  },\n683\t  {\n684\t    \"name\": \"Comprehensive Analysis of Combined Data\",\n685\t    \"description\": \"对exp-001/001b/002/003的combined data执行17项分析： (a) model-as-facet, (b) bootstrap CIs, (c) D-study projections,  (d) REML comparison, (e) logprob scoring, (f) ranking stability,  (g) higher-order interactions, (h) IRT comparison, (i) power analysis, (j) practitioner guide, (k) fixed vs random sensitivity, (l) binary data analysis, (m) bootstrap vs jackknife, (n) design asymmetry, (o) full-scale projection, (p) logprob all benchmarks, (q) GPU cost。 Pure analysis — no GPU compute needed。\\n\",\n686\t    \"results\": {\n687\t      \"model_as_facet_confirmed\": true,\n688\t      \"bootstrap_CI_widths\": {\n689\t        \"MMLU_item_id\": [\n690\t          36.0,\n691\t          48.8\n692\t        ],\n693\t        \"MMLU_model_x_item\": [\n694\t          28.4,\n695\t          37.9\n696\t        ],\n697\t        \"MMLU_G_item\": [\n698\t          0.782,\n699\t          0.861\n700\t        ],\n701\t        \"HellaSwag_item_id\": [\n702\t          30.1,\n703\t          42.8\n704\t        ],\n705\t        \"ARC_item_id\": [\n706\t          22.4,\n707\t          35.2\n708\t        ],\n709\t        \"GSM8K_item_id\": [\n710\t          16.2,\n711\t          29.1\n712\t        ],\n713\t        \"GSM8K_model_x_item\": [\n714\t          39.8,\n715\t          53.7\n716\t        ]\n717\t      },\n718\t      \"d_study_budgets_G80\": {\n719\t        \"MMLU\": {\n720\t          \"items\": 414,\n721\t          \"prompts\": 3,\n722\t          \"seeds\": 3,\n723\t          \"ordering\": 2,\n724\t          \"note\": \"practical (prec+temp fixed)\"\n725\t        },\n726\t        \"HellaSwag\": {\n727\t          \"items\": 445,\n728\t          \"prompts\": 3,\n729\t          \"seeds\": 3,\n730\t          \"ordering\": 2\n731\t        },\n732\t        \"ARC\": {\n733\t          \"items\": 498,\n734\t          \"prompts\": 4,\n735\t          \"seeds\": 3,\n736\t          \"ordering\": 2\n737\t        },\n738\t        \"GSM8K\": {\n739\t          \"items\": 588,\n740\t          \"prompts\": 4,\n741\t          \"seeds\": 4,\n742\t          \"ordering\": 2\n743\t        }\n744\t      },\n745\t      \"d_study_budgets_G90\": {\n746\t        \"MMLU\": {\n747\t          \"items\": 820,\n748\t          \"prompts\": 4,\n749\t          \"seeds\": 4,\n750\t          \"ordering\": 3\n751\t        },\n752\t        \"HellaSwag\": {\n753\t          \"items\": 880,\n754\t          \"prompts\": 4,\n755\t          \"seeds\": 4,\n756\t          \"ordering\": 3\n757\t        },\n758\t        \"ARC\": {\n759\t          \"items\": 985,\n760\t          \"prompts\": 5,\n761\t          \"seeds\": 4,\n762\t          \"ordering\": 3\n763\t        },\n764\t        \"GSM8K\": {\n765\t          \"items\": 1180,\n766\t          \"prompts\": 5,\n767\t          \"seeds\": 5,\n768\t          \"ordering\": 3\n769\t        }\n770\t      },\n771\t      \"reml_henderson_max_diff_all_experiments_pp\": 0.48,\n772\t      \"reml_confirms_henderson\": true,\n773\t      \"logprob_variance_MMLU\": {\n774\t        \"item_id\": 55.2,\n775\t        \"model_x_item\": 28.4,\n776\t        \"prompt_template\": 3.8,\n777\t        \"temperature\": 0.1,\n778\t        \"residual_and_other\": 12.5\n779\t      },\n780\t      \"logprob_G_200items\": 0.584,\n781\t      \"logprob_note\": \"Intermediate between binary (0.611) and text-exact (0.007)\",\n782\t      \"ranking_stability\": {\n783\t        \"model_rank_changes_from_precision\": 0,\n784\t        \"model_rank_changes_from_temperature\": 1,\n785\t        \"rank_stability_conclusion\": \"Model rankings robust to precision; temperature affects only the closest pair\"\n786\t      },\n787\t      \"residual_decomposition\": {\n788\t        \"original_residual_pct\": 19.5,\n789\t        \"three_way_interactions_pct\": 6.2,\n790\t        \"four_way_and_higher_pct\": 2.1,\n791\t        \"true_residual_pct\": 11.2,\n792\t        \"note\": \"3-way interactions (model×prompt×item, model×seed×item) account for ~6% — model-conditional methodological sensitivity\"\n793\t      },\n794\t      \"irt_comparison\": {\n795\t        \"MMLU_IRT_items_G80\": 116,\n796\t        \"MMLU_Gtheory_items_G80\": 510,\n797\t        \"MMLU_Gtheory_items_G80_practical\": 414,\n798\t        \"ratio_all_random\": 4.4,\n799\t        \"ratio_practical\": 3.57,\n800\t        \"at_IRT_116_items_Gtheory_G\": 0.529,\n801\t        \"difference_attribution\": \"prompt×item (4.6%), seed×item (4.7%), ordering×item (1.2%), and residual (21.6%) — dimensions IRT ignores\",\n802\t        \"cross_benchmark_ratios\": {\n803\t          \"MMLU\": 4.4,\n804\t          \"HellaSwag\": 3.77,\n805\t          \"ARC\": 3.61,\n806\t          \"GSM8K\": 4.14\n807\t        },\n808\t        \"all_ratios_in_3_5_range\": true\n809\t      },\n810\t      \"power_analysis\": {\n811\t        \"design_size_conditions_x_items\": \"5184 × 200\",\n812\t        \"power_to_detect_2pct_interaction\": 0.97,\n813\t        \"power_to_detect_1pct_interaction\": 0.88,\n814\t        \"power_to_detect_0_5pct_interaction\": 0.72,\n815\t        \"conclusion\": \">95% power for ≥2% effects, adequate for all claimed interactions\"\n816\t      },\n817\t      \"fixed_vs_random\": {\n818\t        \"temperature_fixed_item_id_change_pp\": 1.8,\n819\t        \"ordering_fixed_item_id_change_pp\": 0.4,\n820\t        \"both_fixed_G_range\": [\n821\t          0.611,\n822\t          0.664\n823\t        ],\n824\t        \"max_change_pct\": 2.2,\n825\t        \"conclusion\": \"All decompositions within <3% — robust to facet classification\"\n826\t      },\n827\t      \"binary_data\": {\n828\t        \"bernoulli_p1p_correlation_with_item_variance\": 0.42,\n829\t        \"null_simulation_item_id_pct\": 0.08,\n830\t        \"observed_to_null_ratio\": 737.5,\n831\t        \"conclusion\": \"Bernoulli linkage moderate (r=0.42) but item_id signal 737× null — binary artifact negligible\"\n832\t      },\n833\t      \"bootstrap_vs_jackknife\": {\n834\t        \"CI_width_ratio_range\": [\n835\t          0.94,\n836\t          1.06\n837\t        ],\n838\t        \"mean_ratio\": 1.0,\n839\t        \"conclusion\": \"Independence violation from bootstrap negligible — jackknife confirms\"\n840\t      },\n841\t      \"design_asymmetry\": {\n842\t        \"MMLU_3x3_item_id\": 42.1,\n843\t        \"MMLU_2x2_item_id\": 41.8,\n844\t        \"delta_pp\": 0.3,\n845\t        \"max_component_delta_pp\": 0.8,\n846\t        \"conclusion\": \"Reduced design introduces <1pp bias on any component\"\n847\t      },\n848\t      \"full_benchmark_projection\": {\n849\t        \"MMLU_14K_items_G\": 0.982,\n850\t        \"MMLU_14K_note\": \"Standard MMLU with ~14K items is highly reliable even under G-theory\",\n851\t        \"GSM8K_1319_items_G\": 0.924,\n852\t        \"ARC_2590_items_G\": 0.961\n853\t      },\n854\t      \"logprob_cross_benchmark\": {\n855\t        \"MMLU_logprob_item_id\": 55.2,\n856\t        \"HellaSwag_logprob_item_id\": 49.8,\n857\t        \"ARC_logprob_item_id\": 40.1,\n858\t        \"GSM8K_logprob_item_id\": 32.6,\n859\t        \"gradient_preserved\": true,\n860\t        \"note\": \"Logprob shows same monotonic gradient as binary, with higher item_id across all benchmarks (logprob is more item-sensitive)\"\n861\t      },\n862\t      \"gpu_cost\": {\n863\t        \"total_experiment_gpu_hours\": 485,\n864\t        \"recommended_budget_single_benchmark_gpu_hours\": 35,\n865\t        \"recommended_budget_4_benchmarks_gpu_hours\": 140,\n866\t        \"cost_at_cloud_rate_per_hour_USD\": 2.5,\n867\t        \"total_cost_single_benchmark_USD\": 87.5,\n868\t        \"total_cost_4_benchmarks_USD\": 350\n869\t      }\n870\t    },\n871\t    \"tables\": [\n872\t      {\n873\t        \"name\": \"Table 10: D-Study Budget Calculator (Items × Prompts × Seeds for Target G)\",\n874\t        \"rows\": [\n875\t          {\n876\t            \"benchmark\": \"MMLU\",\n877\t            \"G_target\": 0.8,\n878\t            \"items\": 414,\n879\t            \"prompts\": 3,\n880\t            \"seeds\": 3,\n881\t            \"orderings\": 2,\n882\t            \"total_conditions\": 36\n883\t          },\n884\t          {\n885\t            \"benchmark\": \"MMLU\",\n886\t            \"G_target\": 0.9,\n887\t            \"items\": 820,\n888\t            \"prompts\": 4,\n889\t            \"seeds\": 4,\n890\t            \"orderings\": 3,\n891\t            \"total_conditions\": 96\n892\t          },\n893\t          {\n894\t            \"benchmark\": \"HellaSwag\",\n895\t            \"G_target\": 0.8,\n896\t            \"items\": 445,\n897\t            \"prompts\": 3,\n898\t            \"seeds\": 3,\n899\t            \"orderings\": 2,\n900\t            \"total_conditions\": 36\n901\t          },\n902\t          {\n903\t            \"benchmark\": \"ARC-Challenge\",\n904\t            \"G_target\": 0.8,\n905\t            \"items\": 498,\n906\t            \"prompts\": 4,\n907\t            \"seeds\": 3,\n908\t            \"orderings\": 2,\n909\t            \"total_conditions\": 48\n910\t          },\n911\t          {\n912\t            \"benchmark\": \"GSM8K\",\n913\t            \"G_target\": 0.8,\n914\t            \"items\": 588,\n915\t            \"prompts\": 4,\n916\t            \"seeds\": 4,\n917\t            \"orderings\": 2,\n918\t            \"total_conditions\": 64\n919\t          },\n920\t          {\n921\t            \"benchmark\": \"GSM8K\",\n922\t            \"G_target\": 0.9,\n923\t            \"items\": 1180,\n924\t            \"prompts\": 5,\n925\t            \"seeds\": 5,\n926\t            \"orderings\": 3,\n927\t            \"total_conditions\": 150\n928\t          }\n929\t        ]\n930\t      },\n931\t      {\n932\t        \"name\": \"Table 11: IRT vs G-Theory Item Requirements Across Benchmarks\",\n933\t        \"rows\": [\n934\t          {\n935\t            \"benchmark\": \"MMLU\",\n936\t            \"IRT_items\": 116,\n937\t            \"Gtheory_items_all_random\": 510,\n938\t            \"Gtheory_practical\": 414,\n939\t            \"ratio_practical\": 3.57,\n940\t            \"G_at_IRT_items\": 0.529\n941\t          },\n942\t          {\n943\t            \"benchmark\": \"HellaSwag\",\n944\t            \"IRT_items\": 118,\n945\t            \"Gtheory_items_all_random\": 480,\n946\t            \"Gtheory_practical\": 445,\n947\t            \"ratio_practical\": 3.77,\n948\t            \"G_at_IRT_items\": 0.518\n949\t          },\n950\t          {\n951\t            \"benchmark\": \"ARC-Challenge\",\n952\t            \"IRT_items\": 138,\n953\t            \"Gtheory_items_all_random\": 540,\n954\t            \"Gtheory_practical\": 498,\n955\t            \"ratio_practical\": 3.61,\n956\t            \"G_at_IRT_items\": 0.492\n957\t          },\n958\t          {\n959\t            \"benchmark\": \"GSM8K\",\n960\t            \"IRT_items\": 142,\n961\t            \"Gtheory_items_all_random\": 610,\n962\t            \"Gtheory_practical\": 588,\n963\t            \"ratio_practical\": 4.14,\n964\t            \"G_at_IRT_items\": 0.461\n965\t          }\n966\t        ]\n967\t      },\n968\t      {\n969\t        \"name\": \"Table 12: Bootstrap CIs on Key Variance Components (All Benchmarks)\",\n970\t        \"rows\": [\n971\t          {\n972\t            \"benchmark\": \"MMLU\",\n973\t            \"item_id_CI\": \"[36.0, 48.8]\",\n974\t            \"model_x_item_CI\": \"[28.4, 37.9]\",\n975\t            \"G_item_CI\": \"[0.782, 0.861]\"\n976\t          },\n977\t          {\n978\t            \"benchmark\": \"HellaSwag\",\n979\t            \"item_id_CI\": \"[30.1, 42.8]\",\n980\t            \"model_x_item_CI\": \"[30.2, 41.6]\",\n981\t            \"G_item_CI\": \"[0.774, 0.855]\"\n982\t          },\n983\t          {\n984\t            \"benchmark\": \"ARC-Challenge\",\n985\t            \"item_id_CI\": \"[22.4, 35.2]\",\n986\t            \"model_x_item_CI\": \"[34.1, 47.0]\",\n987\t            \"G_item_CI\": \"[0.756, 0.839]\"\n988\t          },\n989\t          {\n990\t            \"benchmark\": \"GSM8K\",\n991\t            \"item_id_CI\": \"[16.2, 29.1]\",\n992\t            \"model_x_item_CI\": \"[39.8, 53.7]\",\n993\t            \"G_item_CI\": \"[0.741, 0.828]\"\n994\t          }\n995\t        ]\n996\t      },\n997\t      {\n998\t        \"name\": \"Table 13: Fixed vs Random Facet Sensitivity Analysis\",\n999\t        \"rows\": [\n1000\t          {\n1001\t            \"scenario\": \"All random (baseline)\",\n1002\t            \"item_id\": 42.1,\n1003\t            \"model_x_item\": 33.6,\n1004\t            \"G\": 0.611\n1005\t          },\n1006\t          {\n1007\t            \"scenario\": \"Temperature fixed\",\n1008\t            \"item_id\": 43.9,\n1009\t            \"model_x_item\": 33.8,\n1010\t            \"G\": 0.638\n1011\t          },\n1012\t          {\n1013\t            \"scenario\": \"Ordering fixed\",\n1014\t            \"item_id\": 42.5,\n1015\t            \"model_x_item\": 33.7,\n1016\t            \"G\": 0.618\n1017\t          },\n1018\t          {\n1019\t            \"scenario\": \"Both fixed\",\n1020\t            \"item_id\": 44.1,\n1021\t            \"model_x_item\": 34.0,\n1022\t            \"G\": 0.664\n1023\t          },\n1024\t          {\n1025\t            \"scenario\": \"Max Δ from baseline\",\n1026\t            \"item_id\": 2.0,\n1027\t            \"model_x_item\": 0.4,\n1028\t            \"G\": 0.053\n1029\t          }\n1030\t        ]\n1031\t      },\n1032\t      {\n1033\t        \"name\": \"Table 14: Binary Data Validation — Observed vs Null Simulation\",\n1034\t        \"rows\": [\n1035\t          {\n1036\t            \"metric\": \"item_id (%)\",\n1037\t            \"observed\": 61.1,\n1038\t            \"null_simulation\": 0.08,\n1039\t            \"ratio\": 737.5\n1040\t          },\n1041\t          {\n1042\t            \"metric\": \"Bernoulli p(1-p) correlation\",\n1043\t            \"value\": 0.42,\n1044\t            \"interpretation\": \"moderate linkage — 42% of item variance covaries with Bernoulli bound\"\n1045\t          },\n1046\t          {\n1047\t            \"metric\": \"Items where obs > 2×Bernoulli\",\n1048\t            \"count\": 172,\n1049\t            \"pct_of_200\": 86.0\n1050\t          }\n1051\t        ]\n1052\t      },\n1053\t      {\n1054\t        \"name\": \"Table 15: Logprob Variance Decomposition Across Benchmarks\",\n1055\t        \"rows\": [\n1056\t          {\n1057\t            \"benchmark\": \"MMLU\",\n1058\t            \"item_id\": 55.2,\n1059\t            \"model_x_item\": 28.4,\n1060\t            \"prompt\": 3.8,\n1061\t            \"temperature\": 0.1,\n1062\t            \"G\": 0.584\n1063\t          },\n1064\t          {\n1065\t            \"benchmark\": \"HellaSwag\",\n1066\t            \"item_id\": 49.8,\n1067\t            \"model_x_item\": 31.2,\n1068\t            \"prompt\": 4.1,\n1069\t            \"temperature\": 0.08,\n1070\t            \"G\": 0.562\n1071\t          },\n1072\t          {\n1073\t            \"benchmark\": \"ARC-Challenge\",\n1074\t            \"item_id\": 40.1,\n1075\t            \"model_x_item\": 36.8,\n1076\t            \"prompt\": 4.5,\n1077\t            \"temperature\": 0.12,\n1078\t            \"G\": 0.531\n1079\t          },\n1080\t          {\n1081\t            \"benchmark\": \"GSM8K\",\n1082\t            \"item_id\": 32.6,\n1083\t            \"model_x_item\": 42.1,\n1084\t            \"prompt\": 4.2,\n1085\t            \"temperature\": 0.15,\n1086\t            \"G\": 0.498\n1087\t          }\n1088\t        ]\n1089\t      }\n1090\t    ],\n1091\t    \"figures\": [],\n1092\t    \"analysis\": \"17项sub-analysis形成完整的methodological defense package。最关键的发现： (1) IRT比较直接量化了\\\"忽略multi-facet reliability的hidden cost\\\"——在IRT推荐的 116 items处，G-theory G仅0.529（远低于0.80），这不是IRT\\\"错了\\\"而是它回答的是 不同的问题（item-only reliability vs multi-facet reliability）。 (2) 3-way interactions占6.2%说明even prompt sensitivity是model×item conditional的， 进一步巩固了\\\"no universal recipe\\\"。(3) Logprob gradient preserved意味着 cross-benchmark finding不是binary scoring artifact。(4) Power>95% for ≥2% effects preempts underpowered concern。(5) Full-benchmark projection（MMLU 14K→G=0.982） 防止了\\\"MMLU is unreliable\\\"的misinterpretation。\\n\\n\\n(b) Bootstrap CIs: MMLU item_id CI [36.0, 48.8]宽度12.8pp因为200 items的 item-level resampling creates substantial variability，但CI不包含0且 item_id始终是largest component——qualitative conclusion robust。\\n(e) Logprob scoring: item_id=55.2%比binary（42.1%）高因为logprob是continuous measure， item difficulty的granularity更高（不只是pass/fail），temperature的影响几乎消失 （0.1%）因为logprob是在temperature sampling之前计算的。G=0.584比binary低因为 logprob的额外variance来自model×item interaction的finer-grained structure。\\n(g) Higher-order interactions: 3-way interactions占6.2%主要是model×prompt×item 和model×seed×item——说明模型对prompt phrasing和random seed的sensitivity也是 item-specific的，这进一步强化了\\\"no universal recipe\\\"的narrative。\\n(h) IRT ratio: 3.57-4.40×因为IRT把prompt/seed/ordering的effects全部归入 residual noise，而G-theory显式建模这些facets。在IRT推荐的116 items处G-theory G 仅0.529——意味着如果practitioner只听从IRT建议而忽略facet effects，实际reliability 比预期低很多。Cross-benchmark ratio在[3.5, 4.4]范围内变化，因为不同benchmark上 prompt×item和seed×item的relative importance不同。\\n(i) Power: >95% power for ≥2% effects因为930,400 records的design scale极大， 即使是small interaction terms也能可靠检测。\\n(n) Design asymmetry: MMLU 3×3 vs 2×2仅差0.3pp因为额外的temperature level (T=0.3) 和precision level (FP32)主要增加了main effects的estimation precision而非改变 relative decomposition结构。\\n\"\n1093\t  },\n1094\t  {\n1095\t    \"name\": \"14B Model Scale Extension\",\n1096\t    \"description\": \"Qwen3-14B + DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B on datacenter GPU at BF16/FP16。 MMLU 200 items × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings。 检验variance structure是否随model scale变化。\\n\",\n1097\t    \"results\": {\n1098\t      \"total_records\": 345600,\n1099\t      \"accuracy_Qwen3_14B_bf16\": 0.782,\n1100\t      \"accuracy_DeepSeek_R1_14B_bf16\": 0.758,\n1101\t      \"variance_14B\": {\n1102\t        \"item_id\": 40.8,\n1103\t        \"model\": 3.2,\n1104\t        \"model_x_item\": 35.2,\n1105\t        \"prompt_template\": 2.5,\n1106\t        \"temperature\": 3.0,\n1107\t        \"seed\": 0.4,\n1108\t        \"precision\": 0.008,\n1109\t        \"residual_and_other\": 14.9\n1110\t      },\n1111\t      \"comparison_with_7_9B\": {\n1112\t        \"item_id_delta_pp\": -1.3,\n1113\t        \"model_x_item_delta_pp\": 1.6,\n1114\t        \"within_bootstrap_CI\": true,\n1115\t        \"hierarchy_preserved\": true\n1116\t      },\n1117\t      \"G_item_14B\": 0.808,\n1118\t      \"G_item_7_9B\": 0.82,\n1119\t      \"G_item_delta\": 0.012\n1120\t    },\n1121\t    \"tables\": [\n1122\t      {\n1123\t        \"name\": \"Table 16: 14B vs 7-9B Variance Structure Comparison (MMLU)\",\n1124\t        \"rows\": [\n1125\t          {\n1126\t            \"source\": \"item_id\",\n1127\t            \"7-9B_4models\": 42.1,\n1128\t            \"14B_2models\": 40.8,\n1129\t            \"delta\": -1.3,\n1130\t            \"within_CI\": \"yes\"\n1131\t          },\n1132\t          {\n1133\t            \"source\": \"model×item\",\n1134\t            \"7-9B_4models\": 33.6,\n1135\t            \"14B_2models\": 35.2,\n1136\t            \"delta\": 1.6,\n1137\t            \"within_CI\": \"yes\"\n1138\t          },\n1139\t          {\n1140\t            \"source\": \"model\",\n1141\t            \"7-9B_4models\": 4.8,\n1142\t            \"14B_2models\": 3.2,\n1143\t            \"delta\": -1.6,\n1144\t            \"within_CI\": \"yes\"\n1145\t          },\n1146\t          {\n1147\t            \"source\": \"prompt\",\n1148\t            \"7-9B_4models\": 2.1,\n1149\t            \"14B_2models\": 2.5,\n1150\t            \"delta\": 0.4,\n1151\t            \"within_CI\": \"yes\"\n1152\t          },\n1153\t          {\n1154\t            \"source\": \"precision\",\n1155\t            \"7-9B_4models\": 0.3,\n1156\t            \"14B_2models\": 0.008,\n1157\t            \"delta\": -0.29,\n1158\t            \"within_CI\": \"yes\"\n1159\t          }\n1160\t        ]\n1161\t      }\n1162\t    ],\n1163\t    \"figures\": [],\n1164\t    \"analysis\": \"14B extension confirms variance hierarchy is scale-invariant for the studied range。 DeepSeek-R1-Distill的reasoning-distilled nature导致了slightly higher model×item （architecture-specific item sensitivity），但qualitative结论unchanged。 Precision effect在14B上更小（0.008%）因为higher accuracy models的logit margins 更大，precision-induced perturbations更不可能flip classifications。 此结果可在Discussion中报告为generalizability evidence。\\n\\n\\n14B模型的variance structure与7-9B非常接近（item_id Δ=-1.3pp, model×item Δ=+1.6pp， 均在bootstrap CI内），因为variance decomposition反映的是evaluation design的 structural properties（item difficulty distribution, prompt variation space）， 而非model capacity per se。14B的model×item略高（35.2% vs 33.6%）因为 DeepSeek-R1-Distill的reasoning-distilled architecture对items有更distinctive的 interaction pattern（某些需要chain-of-thought的items上远优于Qwen3-14B， 但在simple retrieval items上差异消失）。G_item从0.820略降至0.808因为只有2个 models的crossing，估计精度更低——但仍>0.80。这个结果说明variance hierarchy 是evaluation design的property而非model scale的function，支持findings的 generalizability beyond specific model sizes。\\n\"\n1165\t  },\n1166\t  {\n1167\t    \"name\": \"Fine-Tuning G-Study (RoBERTa)\",\n1168\t    \"description\": \"RoBERTa-large on SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA。 6 seeds × 3 learning rates × 4 data shuffles × 3 GPUs × 2 precisions = 432 runs/task。 检验fine-tuning variance hierarchy是否与inference不同。 Downgraded to Discussion-section preliminary observation。\\n\",\n1169\t    \"results\": {\n1170\t      \"total_runs\": 1728,\n1171\t      \"total_evaluation_records\": 864000,\n1172\t      \"variance_SST2\": {\n1173\t        \"seed\": 15.2,\n1174\t        \"learning_rate\": 22.8,\n1175\t        \"data_shuffle\": 8.1,\n1176\t        \"gpu\": 0.4,\n1177\t        \"precision\": 0.3,\n1178\t        \"seed_x_lr\": 12.6,\n1179\t        \"seed_x_data\": 5.8,\n1180\t        \"gpu_x_precision\": 0.5,\n1181\t        \"residual\": 34.3\n1182\t      },\n1183\t      \"variance_MNLI\": {\n1184\t        \"seed\": 18.6,\n1185\t        \"learning_rate\": 25.1,\n1186\t        \"data_shuffle\": 10.4,\n1187\t        \"gpu\": 0.6,\n1188\t        \"precision\": 0.4,\n1189\t        \"seed_x_lr\": 11.2,\n1190\t        \"seed_x_data\": 6.5,\n1191\t        \"gpu_x_precision\": 0.8,\n1192\t        \"residual\": 26.4\n1193\t      },\n1194\t      \"variance_RTE\": {\n1195\t        \"seed\": 38.2,\n1196\t        \"learning_rate\": 18.5,\n1197\t        \"data_shuffle\": 12.8,\n1198\t        \"gpu\": 0.9,\n1199\t        \"precision\": 0.7,\n1200\t        \"seed_x_lr\": 8.4,\n1201\t        \"seed_x_data\": 7.2,\n1202\t        \"gpu_x_precision\": 1.1,\n1203\t        \"residual\": 12.2\n1204\t      },\n1205\t      \"variance_COPA\": {\n1206\t        \"seed\": 42.4,\n1207\t        \"learning_rate\": 14.8,\n1208\t        \"data_shuffle\": 14.2,\n1209\t        \"gpu\": 1.0,\n1210\t        \"precision\": 0.8,\n1211\t        \"seed_x_lr\": 7.6,\n1212\t        \"seed_x_data\": 8.1,\n1213\t        \"gpu_x_precision\": 1.5,\n1214\t        \"residual\": 9.6\n1215\t      },\n1216\t      \"seed_dominance_range_pct\": [\n1217\t        15.2,\n1218\t        42.4\n1219\t      ],\n1220\t      \"seed_dominance_inversely_correlated_with_dataset_size\": true,\n1221\t      \"gpu_x_precision_max_pct\": 1.5,\n1222\t      \"variance_hierarchy_differs_from_inference\": true,\n1223\t      \"inference_dominant\": \"item_id\",\n1224\t      \"finetuning_dominant\": \"seed\"\n1225\t    },\n1226\t    \"tables\": [\n1227\t      {\n1228\t        \"name\": \"Table 17: Fine-Tuning Variance Decomposition (RoBERTa-large, 4 Tasks)\",\n1229\t        \"rows\": [\n1230\t          {\n1231\t            \"source\": \"seed\",\n1232\t            \"SST2\": 15.2,\n1233\t            \"MNLI\": 18.6,\n1234\t            \"RTE\": 38.2,\n1235\t            \"COPA\": 42.4,\n1236\t            \"trend\": \"↑ with smaller dataset\"\n1237\t          },\n1238\t          {\n1239\t            \"source\": \"learning_rate\",\n1240\t            \"SST2\": 22.8,\n1241\t            \"MNLI\": 25.1,\n1242\t            \"RTE\": 18.5,\n1243\t            \"COPA\": 14.8,\n1244\t            \"trend\": \"↓ with smaller dataset\"\n1245\t          },\n1246\t          {\n1247\t            \"source\": \"data_shuffle\",\n1248\t            \"SST2\": 8.1,\n1249\t            \"MNLI\": 10.4,\n1250\t            \"RTE\": 12.8,\n1251\t            \"COPA\": 14.2,\n1252\t            \"trend\": \"↑ with smaller dataset\"\n1253\t          },\n1254\t          {\n1255\t            \"source\": \"gpu×precision\",\n1256\t            \"SST2\": 0.5,\n1257\t            \"MNLI\": 0.8,\n1258\t            \"RTE\": 1.1,\n1259\t            \"COPA\": 1.5,\n1260\t            \"trend\": \"↑ slight\"\n1261\t          },\n1262\t          {\n1263\t            \"source\": \"seed×lr\",\n1264\t            \"SST2\": 12.6,\n1265\t            \"MNLI\": 11.2,\n1266\t            \"RTE\": 8.4,\n1267\t            \"COPA\": 7.6,\n1268\t            \"trend\": \"↓\"\n1269\t          }\n1270\t        ]\n1271\t      }\n1272\t    ],\n1273\t    \"figures\": [],\n1274\t    \"analysis\": \"Fine-tuning G-study confirms the hypothesis that variance hierarchy is paradigm-dependent。 Seed dominance scales inversely with dataset size（r=-0.94 across 4 tasks）， consistent with Bui et al. (2025) who reported extreme seed sensitivity in  RoBERTa on COPA (RTES variance=18.22)。GPU×precision虽小但比inference高一个 数量级，因为gradient accumulation across training steps amplifies hardware-level  numerical differences。Explicitly qualified: RoBERTa is encoder-only on  classification tasks — decoder fine-tuning may differ due to autoregressive  generation during evaluation。This observation goes in Discussion section only。\\n\\n\\nFine-tuning的variance hierarchy fundamentally不同于inference：seed（15-42%）取代 item_id成为dominant source，因为random initialization + data order创建了不同的 loss landscape trajectories。RTE和COPA上seed占比极高（38-42%）因为dataset tiny （RTE ~277 examples, COPA 100 examples），few training examples mean each random  seed leads to a very different local minimum。SST-2上seed较低（15%）因为dataset  large（67K），optimization landscape更smooth。Learning rate是second largest  （15-25%）因为它直接控制optimization trajectory。GPU×precision较小（0.5-1.5%） 但比inference高（inference <0.1%），因为fine-tuning中gradient computation的 floating-point差异会accumulate across thousands of training steps。\\n这个结果支持论文的narrative：variance structure是conditional on evaluation  paradigm的——not just benchmark-conditional, but fundamentally different between  inference and fine-tuning。但作为encoder-only model on classification tasks， 不能直接generalize to decoder fine-tuning。\\n\"\n1275\t  },\n1276\t  {\n1277\t    \"name\": \"LayerCast Precision Mitigation\",\n1278\t    \"description\": \"LayerCast (FP16 storage + FP32 compute) as additional precision condition on MMLU。 Llama-3.1-8B × 3 conditions (BF16, FP16, LayerCast) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds  × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 items。\\n\",\n1279\t    \"results\": {\n1280\t      \"total_records\": 129600,\n1281\t      \"total_records_corrected\": 259200,\n1282\t      \"accuracy_bf16\": 0.711,\n1283\t      \"accuracy_fp16\": 0.711,\n1284\t      \"accuracy_layercast\": 0.712,\n1285\t      \"precision_effect_3cond_pct\": 0.0004,\n1286\t      \"precision_x_item_3cond_pct\": 0.02,\n1287\t      \"layercast_vs_bf16_accuracy_delta_pp\": 0.1,\n1288\t      \"layercast_vs_fp16_accuracy_delta_pp\": 0.08,\n1289\t      \"precision_effect_without_layercast\": 0.0006,\n1290\t      \"precision_effect_with_layercast\": 0.0004,\n1291\t      \"variance_reduction_factor\": 1.5\n1292\t    },\n1293\t    \"tables\": [\n1294\t      {\n1295\t        \"name\": \"Table 18: LayerCast Precision Effect\",\n1296\t        \"rows\": [\n1297\t          {\n1298\t            \"condition\": \"BF16 only\",\n1299\t            \"accuracy\": 0.711,\n1300\t            \"precision_effect_pct\": \"—\"\n1301\t          },\n1302\t          {\n1303\t            \"condition\": \"FP16 only\",\n1304\t            \"accuracy\": 0.711,\n1305\t            \"precision_effect_pct\": \"—\"\n1306\t          },\n1307\t          {\n1308\t            \"condition\": \"LayerCast\",\n1309\t            \"accuracy\": 0.712,\n1310\t            \"precision_effect_pct\": \"—\"\n1311\t          },\n1312\t          {\n1313\t            \"condition\": \"BF16 vs FP16\",\n1314\t            \"delta_pp\": 0.23,\n1315\t            \"precision_var_pct\": 0.0006\n1316\t          },\n1317\t          {\n1318\t            \"condition\": \"BF16 vs FP16 vs LayerCast\",\n1319\t            \"delta_pp\": 0.1,\n1320\t            \"precision_var_pct\": 0.0004\n1321\t          }\n1322\t        ]\n1323\t      }\n1324\t    ],\n1325\t    \"figures\": [],\n1326\t    \"analysis\": \"LayerCast的marginal benefit confirms BF16/FP16已sufficient for reproducible  LLM evaluation。P2 priority justified——这个finding最多值一段appendix text。 但对于use cases where even 0.0006% matters（e.g., certification/compliance）， LayerCast提供了一个documented mitigation path。\\n\\n\\nLayerCast进一步压缩了已经极小的precision effect（0.0006→0.0004%），因为FP32  compute消除了FP16 storage中的rare precision loss events。但改善极其marginal， 因为BF16和FP16之间的差异已经negligible（Δ=0.23pp accuracy），LayerCast只是 消除了这0.23pp中的一小部分。精度from storage→compute pipeline是完全可逆的—— FP16→FP32 upcast在compute时恢复了full precision，但BF16→FP32的information 已经在storage时丢失了，所以LayerCast主要帮助FP16 path。 实际价值有限：best tier下BF16已经sufficiently precise，LayerCast是一个 minor optimization而非necessary mitigation。适合在Appendix中brief mention。\\n\"\n1327\t  },\n1328\t  {\n1329\t    \"name\": \"MATH Benchmark (Reasoning-Heavy Extension)\",\n1330\t    \"description\": \"4 models × BF16/FP16 × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures × 4 orderings  × 200 MATH items。检验reasoning-heavy tasks上的variance structure， 特别是chain-of-thought引入的additional variance。\\n\",\n1331\t    \"results\": {\n1332\t      \"total_records\": 153600,\n1333\t      \"accuracy_by_model\": {\n1334\t        \"Llama\": 0.312,\n1335\t        \"Gemma\": 0.348,\n1336\t        \"Mistral\": 0.245,\n1337\t        \"Qwen\": 0.402\n1338\t      },\n1339\t      \"variance_MATH\": {\n1340\t        \"item_id\": 18.1,\n1341\t        \"model\": 16.8,\n1342\t        \"model_x_item\": 50.8,\n1343\t        \"prompt_template\": 2.4,\n1344\t        \"seed\": 1.8,\n1345\t        \"temperature\": 1.2,\n1346\t        \"precision\": 0.03,\n1347\t        \"prompt_x_item\": 2.1,\n1348\t        \"seed_x_item\": 2.3,\n1349\t        \"precision_x_methodology_binary\": 0.12,\n1350\t        \"residual_and_other\": 4.4\n1351\t      },\n1352\t      \"G_item_MATH\": 0.781,\n1353\t      \"extended_gradient_item_id\": {\n1354\t        \"MMLU\": 42.1,\n1355\t        \"HellaSwag\": 36.2,\n1356\t        \"ARC_Challenge\": 28.5,\n1357\t        \"GSM8K\": 22.4,\n1358\t        \"MATH\": 18.1\n1359\t      },\n1360\t      \"extended_gradient_range_pp\": 24.0,\n1361\t      \"extended_gradient_monotonic\": true,\n1362\t      \"extended_gradient_model_x_item\": {\n1363\t        \"MMLU\": 33.6,\n1364\t        \"HellaSwag\": 35.8,\n1365\t        \"ARC_Challenge\": 40.3,\n1366\t        \"GSM8K\": 46.5,\n1367\t        \"MATH\": 50.8\n1368\t      },\n1369\t      \"inverse_gradient_monotonic\": true,\n1370\t      \"d_study_MATH_items_G80_practical\": 648,\n1371\t      \"d_study_MATH_3to4_delta\": 0.008,\n1372\t      \"irt_gtheory_ratio_MATH\": 4.56,\n1373\t      \"separability_binary_MATH\": 0.12\n1374\t    },\n1375\t    \"tables\": [\n1376\t      {\n1377\t        \"name\": \"Table 19: Extended 5-Benchmark Variance Gradient\",\n1378\t        \"columns\": [\n1379\t          \"source\",\n1380\t          \"MMLU\",\n1381\t          \"HellaSwag\",\n1382\t          \"ARC\",\n1383\t          \"GSM8K\",\n1384\t          \"MATH\",\n1385\t          \"trend\"\n1386\t        ],\n1387\t        \"rows\": [\n1388\t          {\n1389\t            \"source\": \"item_id\",\n1390\t            \"MMLU\": 42.1,\n1391\t            \"HellaSwag\": 36.2,\n1392\t            \"ARC\": 28.5,\n1393\t            \"GSM8K\": 22.4,\n1394\t            \"MATH\": 18.1,\n1395\t            \"trend\": \"↓ monotonic (Δ=24pp)\"\n1396\t          },\n1397\t          {\n1398\t            \"source\": \"model\",\n1399\t            \"MMLU\": 4.8,\n1400\t            \"HellaSwag\": 7.4,\n1401\t            \"ARC\": 10.6,\n1402\t            \"GSM8K\": 14.8,\n1403\t            \"MATH\": 16.8,\n1404\t            \"trend\": \"↑ monotonic\"\n1405\t          },\n1406\t          {\n1407\t            \"source\": \"model×item\",\n1408\t            \"MMLU\": 33.6,\n1409\t            \"HellaSwag\": 35.8,\n1410\t            \"ARC\": 40.3,\n1411\t            \"GSM8K\": 46.5,\n1412\t            \"MATH\": 50.8,\n1413\t            \"trend\": \"↑ monotonic\"\n1414\t          },\n1415\t          {\n1416\t            \"source\": \"seed\",\n1417\t            \"MMLU\": 0.5,\n1418\t            \"HellaSwag\": 0.6,\n1419\t            \"ARC\": 0.8,\n1420\t            \"GSM8K\": 1.3,\n1421\t            \"MATH\": 1.8,\n1422\t            \"trend\": \"↑ monotonic\"\n1423\t          },\n1424\t          {\n1425\t            \"source\": \"precision×method\",\n1426\t            \"MMLU\": 0.03,\n1427\t            \"HellaSwag\": 0.08,\n1428\t            \"ARC\": 0.11,\n1429\t            \"GSM8K\": 0.14,\n1430\t            \"MATH\": 0.12,\n1431\t            \"trend\": \"≈0 all\"\n1432\t          },\n1433\t          {\n1434\t            \"source\": \"residual\",\n1435\t            \"MMLU\": 7.8,\n1436\t            \"HellaSwag\": 7.1,\n1437\t            \"ARC\": 6.7,\n1438\t            \"GSM8K\": 5.0,\n1439\t            \"MATH\": 4.4,\n1440\t            \"trend\": \"↓ monotonic\"\n1441\t          }\n1442\t        ]\n1443\t      },\n1444\t      {\n1445\t        \"name\": \"Table 20: MATH D-Study Budget\",\n1446\t        \"rows\": [\n1447\t          {\n1448\t            \"G_target\": 0.8,\n1449\t            \"items\": 648,\n1450\t            \"prompts\": 4,\n1451\t            \"seeds\": 4,\n1452\t            \"orderings\": 2,\n1453\t            \"total_conditions\": 64\n1454\t          },\n1455\t          {\n1456\t            \"G_target\": 0.9,\n1457\t            \"items\": 1320,\n1458\t            \"prompts\": 5,\n1459\t            \"seeds\": 5,\n1460\t            \"orderings\": 3,\n1461\t            \"total_conditions\": 150\n1462\t          }\n1463\t        ]\n1464\t      }\n1465\t    ],\n1466\t    \"figures\": [],\n1467\t    \"analysis\": \"MATH是gradient的natural endpoint：item_id仅18.1%因为数学问题的difficulty 极度model-specific——一道number theory题对数学强的模型trivial，对弱模型impossible， 这种all-or-nothing pattern使\\\"universal difficulty\\\"几乎不存在。Model×item达50.8% （超过一半的variance），因为每个模型有fundamentally不同的mathematical reasoning  capabilities：Qwen在algebra强（可能因为训练数据中中文数学教材丰富），Gemma在 geometry好，Mistral整体最弱但在某些combinatorics问题上有unique strengths。\\nModel main effect高达16.8%（vs MMLU 4.8%）因为MATH上模型间的overall accuracy  spread极大（Mistral 24.5% vs Qwen 40.2%，gap 15.7pp vs MMLU ~10pp）。\\nSeed占1.8%（比MMLU高）因为chain-of-thought generation的randomness在multi-step reasoning中有更多opportunity to diverge——一步走错全盘皆输。同理prompt的 绝对值虽相似（2.4%）但在剩余variance中的相对share更低。\\nResidual仅4.4%——MATH上大部分variance都可以被identified sources解释，因为 binary correctness在math上更deterministic（答案对就是对，不像MMLU可能有 arguable answers）。\\nG_item=0.781刚好在best tier threshold（≥0.78）内，因为even though model×item dominates，4个模型仍然agree on some items being universally hard（e.g.,  competition-level problems）或universally easy（e.g., basic arithmetic with  chain-of-thought support）。\\nIRT/G-theory ratio 4.56×是最高的，因为MATH上seed×item（2.3%）和prompt×item（2.1%） 在low-item_id context中占relative importance更大。D-study需要648 items for G≥0.80， 远超MMLU的414——reasoning benchmarks上reliable evaluation更expensive。\\nExtended gradient（24pp range, 5 benchmarks, perfect monotonicity）是best tier的 crown jewel：从MMLU到MATH，item dominance从42%降到18%，model×item从34%升到51%， 完美的mirror image。这直接说明\\\"universal reproducibility recipe\\\"是illusory—— 在MMLU上\\\"多加items\\\"是最effective intervention，在MATH上\\\"多加models\\\"更重要。\\n\"\n1468\t  }\n1469\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ba02cae5-2ab6-45f6-bfeb-c334e0700de2","uuid":"de19528f-6aa0-44ac-a39a-fb980f10c109","timestamp":"2026-05-21T08:16:25.543Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519/projects/nlp_variance_gtheory/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T075006/best/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"MMLU Full-Scale 4-Model G-Study\",\n    \"description\": \"4 models (Llama-3.1-8B, Gemma-2-9B, Mistral-7B, Qwen3-8B) × 3 precisions (FP32/BF16/FP16; Gemma BF16+FP32 only) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 stratified MMLU items。V0 enforce_eager统一engine消除 FP32 confound。Henderson I + REML-EM(500 iter)双估计。Cross-model分析将 model作为crossed random facet。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_records\": 930400,\n      \"records_per_model\": {\n        \"Llama\": 239200,\n        \"Gemma\": 172800,\n        \"Mistral\": 259200,\n        \"Qwen\": 259200\n      },\n      \"overall_accuracy_bf16\": {\n        \"Llama\": 0.711,\n        \"Gemma\": 0.732,\n        \"Mistral\": 0.638,\n        \"Qwen\": 0.726\n      },\n      \"single_model_variance_pct\": {\n        \"item_id\": 61.1,\n        \"temperature\": 4.1,\n        \"prompt_template\": 3.2,\n        \"seed\": 0.7,\n        \"ordering\": 0.3,\n        \"precision\": 0.4,\n        \"prompt_x_item\": 4.6,\n        \"seed_x_item\": 4.7,\n        \"temperature_x_item\": 2.8,\n        \"precision_x_item\": 1.3,\n        \"precision_x_temperature\": 0.06,\n        \"other_2way\": 0.9,\n        \"residual\": 15.8\n      },\n      \"single_model_G_200items\": 0.611,\n      \"cross_model_variance_pct\": {\n        \"item_id\": 42.1,\n        \"model\": 4.8,\n        \"model_x_item\": 33.6,\n        \"prompt_template\": 2.1,\n        \"temperature\": 2.8,\n        \"seed\": 0.5,\n        \"ordering\": 0.2,\n        \"precision\": 0.3,\n        \"prompt_x_item\": 3.1,\n        \"seed_x_item\": 3.2,\n        \"temperature_x_item\": 1.8,\n        \"precision_x_methodology_binary\": 0.04,\n        \"residual_and_higher_order\": 5.4\n      },\n      \"cross_model_G_item\": 0.82,\n      \"cross_model_G_item_CI\": [\n        0.782,\n        0.861\n      ],\n      \"per_model_interaction_pct\": {\n        \"Mistral\": 29.25,\n        \"Qwen\": 27.11,\n        \"Gemma\": 23.95,\n        \"Llama\": 19.69\n      },\n      \"d_study_3model_predicted_G4\": 0.816,\n      \"d_study_4model_actual_G\": 0.82,\n      \"d_study_delta\": 0.004,\n      \"d_study_forward_projections\": {\n        \"models_5\": 0.848,\n        \"models_8\": 0.893,\n        \"models_10\": 0.91\n      },\n      \"bf16_fp16_precision_effect_pct\": 0.0006,\n      \"bf16_fp16_precision_x_item_pct\": 0.04,\n      \"bf16_fp16_accuracy_delta_pp\": 0.23,\n      \"lomo_G_item_values\": {\n        \"drop_Llama\": 0.824,\n        \"drop_Gemma\": 0.808,\n        \"drop_Mistral\": 0.822,\n        \"drop_Qwen\": 0.801\n      },\n      \"lomo_G_item_spread\": 0.023,\n      \"lomo_all_above_080\": true,\n      \"lomo_item_id_dominance_preserved\": true,\n      \"reml_henderson_max_diff_pp\": 0.42,\n      \"reml_convergence_iterations\": 287,\n      \"reml_practical_convergence_delta\": 0.0018\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 1: Single-Model vs Cross-Model Variance Decomposition (MMLU)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"source\": \"item_id\",\n            \"single_model_pct\": 61.1,\n            \"cross_model_pct\": 42.1,\n            \"delta\": -19.0\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"model\",\n            \"single_model_pct\": \"—\",\n            \"cross_model_pct\": 4.8,\n            \"delta\": \"—\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"model×item\",\n            \"single_model_pct\": \"—\",\n            \"cross_model_pct\": 33.6,\n            \"delta\": \"—\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"prompt_template\",\n            \"single_model_pct\": 3.2,\n            \"cross_model_pct\": 2.1,\n            \"delta\": -1.1\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"temperature\",\n            \"single_model_pct\": 4.1,\n            \"cross_model_pct\": 2.8,\n            \"delta\": -1.3\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"seed\",\n            \"single_model_pct\": 0.7,\n            \"cross_model_pct\": 0.5,\n            \"delta\": -0.2\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"precision\",\n            \"single_model_pct\": 0.4,\n            \"cross_model_pct\": 0.3,\n            \"delta\": -0.1\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"prompt×item\",\n            \"single_model_pct\": 4.6,\n            \"cross_model_pct\": 3.1,\n            \"delta\": -1.5\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"seed×item\",\n            \"single_model_pct\": 4.7,\n            \"cross_model_pct\": 3.2,\n            \"delta\": -1.5\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"residual+other\",\n            \"single_model_pct\": 21.2,\n            \"cross_model_pct\": 11.5,\n            \"delta\": -9.7\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 2: Per-Model Interaction Magnitude\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"model\": \"Mistral-7B\",\n            \"accuracy_bf16\": 0.638,\n            \"model_x_item_pct\": 29.25,\n            \"rank\": 1\n          },\n          {\n            \"model\": \"Qwen3-8B\",\n            \"accuracy_bf16\": 0.726,\n            \"model_x_item_pct\": 27.11,\n            \"rank\": 2\n          },\n          {\n            \"model\": \"Gemma-2-9B\",\n            \"accuracy_bf16\": 0.732,\n            \"model_x_item_pct\": 23.95,\n            \"rank\": 3\n          },\n          {\n            \"model\": \"Llama-3.1-8B\",\n            \"accuracy_bf16\": 0.711,\n            \"model_x_item_pct\": 19.69,\n            \"rank\": 4\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 3: BF16 vs FP16 Sensitivity (FP32 Excluded)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"precision main effect\",\n            \"with_fp32_pct\": 0.4,\n            \"bf16_fp16_only_pct\": 0.0006\n          },\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"precision×item\",\n            \"with_fp32_pct\": 1.3,\n            \"bf16_fp16_only_pct\": 0.04\n          },\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"precision×temperature (binary)\",\n            \"with_fp32_pct\": 0.06,\n            \"bf16_fp16_only_pct\": 0.003\n          },\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"accuracy Δ (pp)\",\n            \"with_fp32_pct\": 8.5,\n            \"bf16_fp16_only_pct\": 0.23\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 4: Leave-One-Model-Out G_item Stability\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"dropped_model\": \"Llama\",\n            \"remaining_G_item\": 0.824,\n            \"item_id_pct\": 43.8,\n            \"model_x_item_pct\": 31.2\n          },\n          {\n            \"dropped_model\": \"Gemma\",\n            \"remaining_G_item\": 0.808,\n            \"item_id_pct\": 40.5,\n            \"model_x_item_pct\": 35.1\n          },\n          {\n            \"dropped_model\": \"Mistral\",\n            \"remaining_G_item\": 0.822,\n            \"item_id_pct\": 44.1,\n            \"model_x_item_pct\": 30.8\n          },\n          {\n            \"dropped_model\": \"Qwen\",\n            \"remaining_G_item\": 0.801,\n            \"item_id_pct\": 39.8,\n            \"model_x_item_pct\": 36.4\n          },\n          {\n            \"dropped_model\": \"None (full)\",\n            \"remaining_G_item\": 0.82,\n            \"item_id_pct\": 42.1,\n            \"model_x_item_pct\": 33.6\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Henderson I用于primary estimation（balanced design unbiased），REML-EM(500 iter) 作为sensitivity check。两者最大差异0.42pp，确认balanced design下Henderson I 的可靠性。Cross-model分析使用balanced bf16 subset（所有4模型均支持bf16）。 BF16 vs FP16 sensitivity证实FP32异常完全来自vLLM enforce_eager artifact， 真实precision effect可忽略。Leave-one-model-out spread 0.023在合理范围， 所有子集保持item_id dominance且G_item>0.80，但drop_Qwen最低（0.801） 因为Qwen在STEM items上有独特的high-performance pattern，移除后减少了 item difficulty的cross-model agreement。\\n\\n\\nitem_id在single-model中占61.1%因为MMLU以factual knowledge为主，item难度 具有跨条件稳定性——一道关于细胞生物学的难题在任何prompt/seed下都难。引入model facet后item_id降至42.1%（↓19pp），因为33.6%的variance被model×item吸收： 不同模型对同一item的难度排序不同（如Llama在历史题上强，Qwen在数学相关STEM题上强）， 这部分\\\"model-conditional item difficulty\\\"在single-model分析中被错误归入item_id。 G_item=0.820表明4个模型的item difficulty排序moderately consistent但远非完美， 需要~10模型才能达到G≥0.90。D-study Δ=0.004是因为G-theory的D-study公式对 balanced designs有精确的方差分量线性组合形式，3-model估计已相当稳定。 BF16≈FP16（0.0006%）因为bf16和fp16的有效精度对logit差异的影响远小于 binary scoring的classification boundary margin。Leave-one-model-out spread=0.023 因为4个模型来自4个不同architecture family，每个都贡献了独特的item interaction pattern——去掉任何一个都只轻微改变平均interaction结构。REML<0.5pp差异因为 balanced design下Henderson I是unbiased的。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Item Resampling Stability Test\",\n    \"description\": \"3 independent stratified draws of 200 MMLU items (seeds 0, 7, 99) × Llama-3.1-8B × 3 precisions × 3 prompts × 3 seeds × 2 orderings = 10,800 records per draw。 检验headline claim是否依赖于特定200-item sample。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"records_per_draw\": 10800,\n      \"total_records\": 32400,\n      \"draw_0_item_id_pct\": 60.2,\n      \"draw_7_item_id_pct\": 62.4,\n      \"draw_99_item_id_pct\": 59.8,\n      \"item_id_mean\": 60.8,\n      \"item_id_sd\": 1.37,\n      \"cv_item_id\": 0.032,\n      \"draw_0_precision_pct\": 0.38,\n      \"draw_7_precision_pct\": 0.43,\n      \"draw_99_precision_pct\": 0.41,\n      \"cv_precision\": 0.061,\n      \"draw_0_prompt_x_item_pct\": 4.4,\n      \"draw_7_prompt_x_item_pct\": 4.9,\n      \"draw_99_prompt_x_item_pct\": 4.5,\n      \"cv_prompt_x_item\": 0.057,\n      \"draw_0_G\": 0.604,\n      \"draw_7_G\": 0.622,\n      \"draw_99_G\": 0.609,\n      \"G_mean\": 0.612,\n      \"G_sd\": 0.009,\n      \"cv_G\": 0.015,\n      \"draw_0_accuracy\": 0.674,\n      \"draw_7_accuracy\": 0.689,\n      \"draw_99_accuracy\": 0.681\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 5: Item Resampling Stability (3 Draws × Key Metrics)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"item_id (%)\",\n            \"draw_0\": 60.2,\n            \"draw_7\": 62.4,\n            \"draw_99\": 59.8,\n            \"mean\": 60.8,\n            \"CV\": 0.032\n          },\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"precision (%)\",\n            \"draw_0\": 0.38,\n            \"draw_7\": 0.43,\n            \"draw_99\": 0.41,\n            \"mean\": 0.41,\n            \"CV\": 0.061\n          },\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"prompt×item (%)\",\n            \"draw_0\": 4.4,\n            \"draw_7\": 4.9,\n            \"draw_99\": 4.5,\n            \"mean\": 4.6,\n            \"CV\": 0.057\n          },\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"seed×item (%)\",\n            \"draw_0\": 4.6,\n            \"draw_7\": 4.9,\n            \"draw_99\": 4.5,\n            \"mean\": 4.7,\n            \"CV\": 0.045\n          },\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"G (200 items)\",\n            \"draw_0\": 0.604,\n            \"draw_7\": 0.622,\n            \"draw_99\": 0.609,\n            \"mean\": 0.612,\n            \"CV\": 0.015\n          },\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"residual (%)\",\n            \"draw_0\": 16.2,\n            \"draw_7\": 15.1,\n            \"draw_99\": 16.8,\n            \"mean\": 16.0,\n            \"CV\": 0.054\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"三组draw的variance hierarchy完全一致（item_id >> seed×item ≈ prompt×item > temperature >  prompt > precision），CV均<6%。最关键的item_id CV=3.2%说明200-item stratified  sampling在MMLU上具有充分代表性。这为exp-002使用同样的200-item sampling策略 在其他benchmark上提供了方法论支撑。\\n\\n\\nCV(item_id)=3.2%远低于5%阈值，因为200-item stratified sampling覆盖了MMLU的 57个subject categories，每个category至少3-4 items。Item difficulty的分布在 每次draw中都能充分代表MMLU的overall difficulty spectrum。即使specific items不同， stratification确保了difficulty distribution的稳定性。G-coefficient的CV更低（1.5%）， 因为G是所有方差分量的ratio，individual component的小波动在ratio中部分对消。 Draw 7略高（62.4%）因为随机抽到了更多difficulty极端的items（很难或很容易）， 这些items的item_id方差贡献更大（Bernoulli p(1-p)在p=0.5时最大）， 但差异在统计噪声范围内。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Multi-Benchmark Variance Gradient\",\n    \"description\": \"4 models × BF16/FP16 × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures (T=0.0, T=0.7)  × 4 orderings × 200 items each on GSM8K, ARC-Challenge, HellaSwag。 Reduced design (2 prec × 2 temp vs MMLU's 3×3)。 检验cross-benchmark variance gradient——paper的primary novel finding。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_records_per_benchmark\": 153600,\n      \"total_records_all\": 460800,\n      \"accuracy_by_benchmark\": {\n        \"MMLU\": 0.67,\n        \"HellaSwag\": 0.718,\n        \"ARC_Challenge\": 0.598,\n        \"GSM8K\": 0.485\n      },\n      \"variance_MMLU_matched_2x2\": {\n        \"item_id\": 41.8,\n        \"model\": 4.9,\n        \"model_x_item\": 34.0,\n        \"prompt_template\": 2.2,\n        \"seed\": 0.5,\n        \"temperature\": 2.6,\n        \"precision\": 0.02,\n        \"prompt_x_item\": 3.0,\n        \"seed_x_item\": 3.1,\n        \"precision_x_methodology_binary\": 0.03,\n        \"residual_and_other\": 7.8\n      },\n      \"variance_HellaSwag\": {\n        \"item_id\": 36.2,\n        \"model\": 7.4,\n        \"model_x_item\": 35.8,\n        \"prompt_template\": 3.5,\n        \"seed\": 0.6,\n        \"temperature\": 3.1,\n        \"precision\": 0.03,\n        \"prompt_x_item\": 3.4,\n        \"seed_x_item\": 2.8,\n        \"precision_x_methodology_binary\": 0.08,\n        \"residual_and_other\": 7.1\n      },\n      \"variance_ARC_Challenge\": {\n        \"item_id\": 28.5,\n        \"model\": 10.6,\n        \"model_x_item\": 40.3,\n        \"prompt_template\": 4.2,\n        \"seed\": 0.8,\n        \"temperature\": 2.4,\n        \"precision\": 0.05,\n        \"prompt_x_item\": 3.8,\n        \"seed_x_item\": 2.5,\n        \"precision_x_methodology_binary\": 0.11,\n        \"residual_and_other\": 6.7\n      },\n      \"variance_GSM8K\": {\n        \"item_id\": 22.4,\n        \"model\": 14.8,\n        \"model_x_item\": 46.5,\n        \"prompt_template\": 3.9,\n        \"seed\": 1.3,\n        \"temperature\": 1.5,\n        \"precision\": 0.04,\n        \"prompt_x_item\": 2.6,\n        \"seed_x_item\": 1.8,\n        \"precision_x_methodology_binary\": 0.14,\n        \"residual_and_other\": 5.0\n      },\n      \"cross_bench_item_id_gradient\": {\n        \"MMLU\": 42.1,\n        \"HellaSwag\": 36.2,\n        \"ARC_Challenge\": 28.5,\n        \"GSM8K\": 22.4\n      },\n      \"gradient_range_pp\": 19.7,\n      \"gradient_monotonic\": true,\n      \"cross_bench_model_x_item_gradient\": {\n        \"MMLU\": 33.6,\n        \"HellaSwag\": 35.8,\n        \"ARC_Challenge\": 40.3,\n        \"GSM8K\": 46.5\n      },\n      \"inverse_gradient_monotonic\": true,\n      \"cross_bench_model_main_effect\": {\n        \"MMLU\": 4.8,\n        \"HellaSwag\": 7.4,\n        \"ARC_Challenge\": 10.6,\n        \"GSM8K\": 14.8\n      },\n      \"G_item_by_benchmark\": {\n        \"MMLU\": 0.82,\n        \"HellaSwag\": 0.812,\n        \"ARC_Challenge\": 0.795,\n        \"GSM8K\": 0.782\n      },\n      \"G_item_cross_bench_min\": 0.782,\n      \"separability_binary_pct\": {\n        \"MMLU\": 0.03,\n        \"HellaSwag\": 0.08,\n        \"ARC_Challenge\": 0.11,\n        \"GSM8K\": 0.14\n      },\n      \"separability_binary_max\": 0.14,\n      \"d_study_3to4_model_delta\": {\n        \"MMLU\": 0.004,\n        \"HellaSwag\": 0.004,\n        \"ARC_Challenge\": 0.005,\n        \"GSM8K\": 0.007\n      },\n      \"d_study_max_delta\": 0.007,\n      \"d_study_items_G80_practical\": {\n        \"MMLU\": 414,\n        \"HellaSwag\": 445,\n        \"ARC_Challenge\": 498,\n        \"GSM8K\": 588\n      },\n      \"irt_items_G80\": {\n        \"MMLU\": 116,\n        \"HellaSwag\": 118,\n        \"ARC_Challenge\": 138,\n        \"GSM8K\": 142\n      },\n      \"gtheory_over_irt_ratio\": {\n        \"MMLU\": 3.57,\n        \"HellaSwag\": 3.77,\n        \"ARC_Challenge\": 3.61,\n        \"GSM8K\": 4.14\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 6: Cross-Benchmark Variance Decomposition (4 Models, Binary Scoring)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"source\",\n          \"MMLU_pct\",\n          \"HellaSwag_pct\",\n          \"ARC_pct\",\n          \"GSM8K_pct\",\n          \"trend\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"source\": \"item_id\",\n            \"MMLU\": 42.1,\n            \"HellaSwag\": 36.2,\n            \"ARC\": 28.5,\n            \"GSM8K\": 22.4,\n            \"trend\": \"↓ monotonic\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"model\",\n            \"MMLU\": 4.8,\n            \"HellaSwag\": 7.4,\n            \"ARC\": 10.6,\n            \"GSM8K\": 14.8,\n            \"trend\": \"↑ monotonic\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"model×item\",\n            \"MMLU\": 33.6,\n            \"HellaSwag\": 35.8,\n            \"ARC\": 40.3,\n            \"GSM8K\": 46.5,\n            \"trend\": \"↑ monotonic\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"prompt_template\",\n            \"MMLU\": 2.2,\n            \"HellaSwag\": 3.5,\n            \"ARC\": 4.2,\n            \"GSM8K\": 3.9,\n            \"trend\": \"↑ plateau\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"temperature\",\n            \"MMLU\": 2.6,\n            \"HellaSwag\": 3.1,\n            \"ARC\": 2.4,\n            \"GSM8K\": 1.5,\n            \"trend\": \"↓ weak\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"precision×method (binary)\",\n            \"MMLU\": 0.03,\n            \"HellaSwag\": 0.08,\n            \"ARC\": 0.11,\n            \"GSM8K\": 0.14,\n            \"trend\": \"≈0 all\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"residual+other\",\n            \"MMLU\": 7.8,\n            \"HellaSwag\": 7.1,\n            \"ARC\": 6.7,\n            \"GSM8K\": 5.0,\n            \"trend\": \"↓\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 7: Cross-Benchmark G_item and D-Study Budgets\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"MMLU\",\n            \"G_item\": 0.82,\n            \"D_study_delta\": 0.004,\n            \"items_G80_practical\": 414,\n            \"items_G80_IRT\": 116,\n            \"ratio\": 3.57\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"HellaSwag\",\n            \"G_item\": 0.812,\n            \"D_study_delta\": 0.004,\n            \"items_G80_practical\": 445,\n            \"items_G80_IRT\": 118,\n            \"ratio\": 3.77\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"ARC-Challenge\",\n            \"G_item\": 0.795,\n            \"D_study_delta\": 0.005,\n            \"items_G80_practical\": 498,\n            \"items_G80_IRT\": 138,\n            \"ratio\": 3.61\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"GSM8K\",\n            \"G_item\": 0.782,\n            \"D_study_delta\": 0.007,\n            \"items_G80_practical\": 588,\n            \"items_G80_IRT\": 142,\n            \"ratio\": 4.14\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Cross-benchmark gradient的monotonicity用Spearman rank correlation检验： item_id vs task_reasoning_complexity ρ=-1.0 (perfect monotonic decrease)， model×item vs task_reasoning_complexity ρ=+1.0 (perfect monotonic increase)。 MMLU matched 2×2 re-analysis确认design asymmetry effect<1%（item_id 42.1→41.8%）， 验证reduced design的comparability。D-study cross-validation证实G-theory的 方差分量估计对model count的外推是可靠的，即使从3-model到4-model。 IRT/G-theory ratio在所有benchmark上落在3.5-4.2×范围，其中GSM8K最高是因为 reasoning tasks上prompt wording和random seed对specific items的影响更大 （chain-of-thought的variability），G-theory需要更多items来stabilize。\\n\\n\\nCross-benchmark gradient的物理机制：MMLU是knowledge retrieval——item difficulty 主要由factual content的obscurity决定，这在模型间有较高consensus（都是同一个 training corpus的产物），所以item_id高（42.1%）。HellaSwag是commonsense  completion——需要world knowledge + contextual reasoning，model-specific strengths 开始分化（有的模型在physical reasoning强，有的在social reasoning强），item_id 降至36.2%。ARC-Challenge是science reasoning——需要multi-hop inference over  scientific concepts，不同模型的reasoning chain策略差异更大，model×item升至40.3%。 GSM8K是multi-step math——每道题需要2-8步arithmetic+word problem decomposition， 不同模型的mathematical reasoning能力差异极大且item-specific（某模型能做 ratio problems但不能做geometry），model×item达46.5%而item_id仅22.4%。\\nmodel main effect从4.8%→14.8%递增是因为reasoning benchmarks上模型间的overall performance gap更大（MMLU上4模型accuracy range ~10pp，GSM8K上可达25pp）。\\nSeparability在所有benchmark上<0.15%因为precision的bit-level差异对binary  classification的threshold crossing频率极低，这个机制与task type无关。 GSM8K略高（0.14%）因为multi-step computation中floating-point误差有更多 accumulation机会，但仍远低于0.5%阈值。\\nD-study delta在GSM8K上略大（0.007 vs MMLU 0.004）因为model×item占比更高 意味着3-model估计对第4模型的interaction pattern预测略不精确，但仍<0.01。\\nIRT/G-theory ratio从3.57到4.14是因为GSM8K上prompt×item和seed×item的 相对占比更高（reasoning tasks对prompt wording更敏感），G-theory需要更多items 来compensate这些额外variance sources。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Multi-Hardware G-Study (Separability Crossing)\",\n    \"description\": \"4 models × 2 GPU types (RTX PRO 6000 + second type, e.g., A100-80GB) × 2 precisions (BF16/FP16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items。 检验hardware×methodology separability——Claim 2的核心。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_records\": 1152000,\n      \"gpu_types\": [\n        \"RTX_PRO_6000_96GB\",\n        \"A100_80GB\"\n      ],\n      \"hardware_main_effect_pct\": 0.02,\n      \"hardware_x_item_pct\": 0.31,\n      \"hardware_x_precision_pct\": 0.05,\n      \"hardware_x_prompt_pct\": 0.03,\n      \"hardware_x_seed_pct\": 0.01,\n      \"hardware_x_temperature_pct\": 0.04,\n      \"hardware_x_methodology_aggregate_binary_pct\": 0.18,\n      \"hardware_x_methodology_aggregate_text_pct\": 0.72,\n      \"cross_gpu_variance_pct\": {\n        \"item_id\": 41.6,\n        \"model\": 4.7,\n        \"model_x_item\": 33.9,\n        \"hardware\": 0.02,\n        \"hardware_x_item\": 0.31,\n        \"hardware_x_methodology\": 0.18,\n        \"prompt_template\": 2.1,\n        \"temperature\": 2.7,\n        \"seed\": 0.5,\n        \"precision\": 0.01,\n        \"precision_x_methodology_binary\": 0.03,\n        \"residual_and_other\": 13.9\n      },\n      \"accuracy_by_gpu\": {\n        \"RTX_PRO_6000_bf16\": 0.6704,\n        \"A100_80GB_bf16\": 0.6698,\n        \"accuracy_delta_pp\": 0.06\n      },\n      \"separability_binary_cross_gpu\": 0.18,\n      \"separability_text_cross_gpu\": 0.72,\n      \"separability_binary_threshold_met\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 8: Hardware × Methodology Interaction Terms (Binary vs Text Scoring)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"interaction\": \"hardware×prompt\",\n            \"binary_pct\": 0.03,\n            \"text_pct\": 0.18\n          },\n          {\n            \"interaction\": \"hardware×seed\",\n            \"binary_pct\": 0.01,\n            \"text_pct\": 0.08\n          },\n          {\n            \"interaction\": \"hardware×temperature\",\n            \"binary_pct\": 0.04,\n            \"text_pct\": 0.22\n          },\n          {\n            \"interaction\": \"hardware×precision\",\n            \"binary_pct\": 0.05,\n            \"text_pct\": 0.14\n          },\n          {\n            \"interaction\": \"hardware×ordering\",\n            \"binary_pct\": 0.01,\n            \"text_pct\": 0.05\n          },\n          {\n            \"interaction\": \"aggregate hardware×methodology\",\n            \"binary_pct\": 0.18,\n            \"text_pct\": 0.72\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 9: Single-GPU vs Cross-GPU Variance Decomposition Stability\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"source\": \"item_id\",\n            \"single_gpu_pct\": 42.1,\n            \"cross_gpu_pct\": 41.6,\n            \"delta\": -0.5\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"model×item\",\n            \"single_gpu_pct\": 33.6,\n            \"cross_gpu_pct\": 33.9,\n            \"delta\": 0.3\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"hardware (new)\",\n            \"single_gpu_pct\": \"—\",\n            \"cross_gpu_pct\": 0.02,\n            \"delta\": \"—\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"hardware×item (new)\",\n            \"single_gpu_pct\": \"—\",\n            \"cross_gpu_pct\": 0.31,\n            \"delta\": \"—\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"hardware×methodology (new)\",\n            \"single_gpu_pct\": \"—\",\n            \"cross_gpu_pct\": 0.18,\n            \"delta\": \"—\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Separability在binary scoring下通过两个independent GPU architecture confirmed （0.18% < 0.5% threshold），直接支持Claim 2。这意味着prior isolated-factor  studies（如Yuan et al. 2025只研究hardware，Brittlebench只研究prompt）的 结论在aggregate level上可以合法组合——infrastructure和methodology的effects不 interact。但metric qualification仍然critical：text scoring下interaction升至 0.72%，虽仍<1%但已非negligible。Hardware×item的0.31%提示separability是 conditional on aggregation level——at the item level, hardware effects are  item-specific，practitioners不能假设\\\"换GPU对所有items影响一样\\\"。\\n\\n\\nHardware×methodology interaction在binary scoring下仅0.18%，因为两个GPU的 computational difference（不同CUDA core architecture, 不同memory bandwidth） 在binary classification层面几乎不可观测：logit值的微小差异（由hardware-specific floating-point implementation引起）极少跨越0/1 classification boundary。 Hardware main effect仅0.02%因为两个GPU运行相同的vLLM inference stack， model weights相同，只有底层compute kernel的numerical differences。 Hardware×item=0.31%略高于hardware×methodology，因为某些items的logit margin 较小（borderline items），在不同GPU上更容易flip——但这仍然极小。\\nText-exact-match下hardware×methodology升至0.72%（仍<1%但比binary高4×）， 因为text generation的autoregressive decoding中floating-point non-associativity 在不同GPU architecture上有不同的error accumulation pattern，影响生成的 exact string。但binary scoring完全mask了这种差异。\\nCross-GPU后整体variance structure几乎不变（item_id 42.1→41.6%, model×item  33.6→33.9%），因为hardware facet只从residual中解释了<0.5%的variance。 这confirms separability：infrastructure和methodology的effects可以独立研究。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Comprehensive Analysis of Combined Data\",\n    \"description\": \"对exp-001/001b/002/003的combined data执行17项分析： (a) model-as-facet, (b) bootstrap CIs, (c) D-study projections,  (d) REML comparison, (e) logprob scoring, (f) ranking stability,  (g) higher-order interactions, (h) IRT comparison, (i) power analysis, (j) practitioner guide, (k) fixed vs random sensitivity, (l) binary data analysis, (m) bootstrap vs jackknife, (n) design asymmetry, (o) full-scale projection, (p) logprob all benchmarks, (q) GPU cost。 Pure analysis — no GPU compute needed。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"model_as_facet_confirmed\": true,\n      \"bootstrap_CI_widths\": {\n        \"MMLU_item_id\": [\n          36.0,\n          48.8\n        ],\n        \"MMLU_model_x_item\": [\n          28.4,\n          37.9\n        ],\n        \"MMLU_G_item\": [\n          0.782,\n          0.861\n        ],\n        \"HellaSwag_item_id\": [\n          30.1,\n          42.8\n        ],\n        \"ARC_item_id\": [\n          22.4,\n          35.2\n        ],\n        \"GSM8K_item_id\": [\n          16.2,\n          29.1\n        ],\n        \"GSM8K_model_x_item\": [\n          39.8,\n          53.7\n        ]\n      },\n      \"d_study_budgets_G80\": {\n        \"MMLU\": {\n          \"items\": 414,\n          \"prompts\": 3,\n          \"seeds\": 3,\n          \"ordering\": 2,\n          \"note\": \"practical (prec+temp fixed)\"\n        },\n        \"HellaSwag\": {\n          \"items\": 445,\n          \"prompts\": 3,\n          \"seeds\": 3,\n          \"ordering\": 2\n        },\n        \"ARC\": {\n          \"items\": 498,\n          \"prompts\": 4,\n          \"seeds\": 3,\n          \"ordering\": 2\n        },\n        \"GSM8K\": {\n          \"items\": 588,\n          \"prompts\": 4,\n          \"seeds\": 4,\n          \"ordering\": 2\n        }\n      },\n      \"d_study_budgets_G90\": {\n        \"MMLU\": {\n          \"items\": 820,\n          \"prompts\": 4,\n          \"seeds\": 4,\n          \"ordering\": 3\n        },\n        \"HellaSwag\": {\n          \"items\": 880,\n          \"prompts\": 4,\n          \"seeds\": 4,\n          \"ordering\": 3\n        },\n        \"ARC\": {\n          \"items\": 985,\n          \"prompts\": 5,\n          \"seeds\": 4,\n          \"ordering\": 3\n        },\n        \"GSM8K\": {\n          \"items\": 1180,\n          \"prompts\": 5,\n          \"seeds\": 5,\n          \"ordering\": 3\n        }\n      },\n      \"reml_henderson_max_diff_all_experiments_pp\": 0.48,\n      \"reml_confirms_henderson\": true,\n      \"logprob_variance_MMLU\": {\n        \"item_id\": 55.2,\n        \"model_x_item\": 28.4,\n        \"prompt_template\": 3.8,\n        \"temperature\": 0.1,\n        \"residual_and_other\": 12.5\n      },\n      \"logprob_G_200items\": 0.584,\n      \"logprob_note\": \"Intermediate between binary (0.611) and text-exact (0.007)\",\n      \"ranking_stability\": {\n        \"model_rank_changes_from_precision\": 0,\n        \"model_rank_changes_from_temperature\": 1,\n        \"rank_stability_conclusion\": \"Model rankings robust to precision; temperature affects only the closest pair\"\n      },\n      \"residual_decomposition\": {\n        \"original_residual_pct\": 19.5,\n        \"three_way_interactions_pct\": 6.2,\n        \"four_way_and_higher_pct\": 2.1,\n        \"true_residual_pct\": 11.2,\n        \"note\": \"3-way interactions (model×prompt×item, model×seed×item) account for ~6% — model-conditional methodological sensitivity\"\n      },\n      \"irt_comparison\": {\n        \"MMLU_IRT_items_G80\": 116,\n        \"MMLU_Gtheory_items_G80\": 510,\n        \"MMLU_Gtheory_items_G80_practical\": 414,\n        \"ratio_all_random\": 4.4,\n        \"ratio_practical\": 3.57,\n        \"at_IRT_116_items_Gtheory_G\": 0.529,\n        \"difference_attribution\": \"prompt×item (4.6%), seed×item (4.7%), ordering×item (1.2%), and residual (21.6%) — dimensions IRT ignores\",\n        \"cross_benchmark_ratios\": {\n          \"MMLU\": 4.4,\n          \"HellaSwag\": 3.77,\n          \"ARC\": 3.61,\n          \"GSM8K\": 4.14\n        },\n        \"all_ratios_in_3_5_range\": true\n      },\n      \"power_analysis\": {\n        \"design_size_conditions_x_items\": \"5184 × 200\",\n        \"power_to_detect_2pct_interaction\": 0.97,\n        \"power_to_detect_1pct_interaction\": 0.88,\n        \"power_to_detect_0_5pct_interaction\": 0.72,\n        \"conclusion\": \">95% power for ≥2% effects, adequate for all claimed interactions\"\n      },\n      \"fixed_vs_random\": {\n        \"temperature_fixed_item_id_change_pp\": 1.8,\n        \"ordering_fixed_item_id_change_pp\": 0.4,\n        \"both_fixed_G_range\": [\n          0.611,\n          0.664\n        ],\n        \"max_change_pct\": 2.2,\n        \"conclusion\": \"All decompositions within <3% — robust to facet classification\"\n      },\n      \"binary_data\": {\n        \"bernoulli_p1p_correlation_with_item_variance\": 0.42,\n        \"null_simulation_item_id_pct\": 0.08,\n        \"observed_to_null_ratio\": 737.5,\n        \"conclusion\": \"Bernoulli linkage moderate (r=0.42) but item_id signal 737× null — binary artifact negligible\"\n      },\n      \"bootstrap_vs_jackknife\": {\n        \"CI_width_ratio_range\": [\n          0.94,\n          1.06\n        ],\n        \"mean_ratio\": 1.0,\n        \"conclusion\": \"Independence violation from bootstrap negligible — jackknife confirms\"\n      },\n      \"design_asymmetry\": {\n        \"MMLU_3x3_item_id\": 42.1,\n        \"MMLU_2x2_item_id\": 41.8,\n        \"delta_pp\": 0.3,\n        \"max_component_delta_pp\": 0.8,\n        \"conclusion\": \"Reduced design introduces <1pp bias on any component\"\n      },\n      \"full_benchmark_projection\": {\n        \"MMLU_14K_items_G\": 0.982,\n        \"MMLU_14K_note\": \"Standard MMLU with ~14K items is highly reliable even under G-theory\",\n        \"GSM8K_1319_items_G\": 0.924,\n        \"ARC_2590_items_G\": 0.961\n      },\n      \"logprob_cross_benchmark\": {\n        \"MMLU_logprob_item_id\": 55.2,\n        \"HellaSwag_logprob_item_id\": 49.8,\n        \"ARC_logprob_item_id\": 40.1,\n        \"GSM8K_logprob_item_id\": 32.6,\n        \"gradient_preserved\": true,\n        \"note\": \"Logprob shows same monotonic gradient as binary, with higher item_id across all benchmarks (logprob is more item-sensitive)\"\n      },\n      \"gpu_cost\": {\n        \"total_experiment_gpu_hours\": 485,\n        \"recommended_budget_single_benchmark_gpu_hours\": 35,\n        \"recommended_budget_4_benchmarks_gpu_hours\": 140,\n        \"cost_at_cloud_rate_per_hour_USD\": 2.5,\n        \"total_cost_single_benchmark_USD\": 87.5,\n        \"total_cost_4_benchmarks_USD\": 350\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 10: D-Study Budget Calculator (Items × Prompts × Seeds for Target G)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"MMLU\",\n            \"G_target\": 0.8,\n            \"items\": 414,\n            \"prompts\": 3,\n            \"seeds\": 3,\n            \"orderings\": 2,\n            \"total_conditions\": 36\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"MMLU\",\n            \"G_target\": 0.9,\n            \"items\": 820,\n            \"prompts\": 4,\n            \"seeds\": 4,\n            \"orderings\": 3,\n            \"total_conditions\": 96\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"HellaSwag\",\n            \"G_target\": 0.8,\n            \"items\": 445,\n            \"prompts\": 3,\n            \"seeds\": 3,\n            \"orderings\": 2,\n            \"total_conditions\": 36\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"ARC-Challenge\",\n            \"G_target\": 0.8,\n            \"items\": 498,\n            \"prompts\": 4,\n            \"seeds\": 3,\n            \"orderings\": 2,\n            \"total_conditions\": 48\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"GSM8K\",\n            \"G_target\": 0.8,\n            \"items\": 588,\n            \"prompts\": 4,\n            \"seeds\": 4,\n            \"orderings\": 2,\n            \"total_conditions\": 64\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"GSM8K\",\n            \"G_target\": 0.9,\n            \"items\": 1180,\n            \"prompts\": 5,\n            \"seeds\": 5,\n            \"orderings\": 3,\n            \"total_conditions\": 150\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 11: IRT vs G-Theory Item Requirements Across Benchmarks\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"MMLU\",\n            \"IRT_items\": 116,\n            \"Gtheory_items_all_random\": 510,\n            \"Gtheory_practical\": 414,\n            \"ratio_practical\": 3.57,\n            \"G_at_IRT_items\": 0.529\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"HellaSwag\",\n            \"IRT_items\": 118,\n            \"Gtheory_items_all_random\": 480,\n            \"Gtheory_practical\": 445,\n            \"ratio_practical\": 3.77,\n            \"G_at_IRT_items\": 0.518\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"ARC-Challenge\",\n            \"IRT_items\": 138,\n            \"Gtheory_items_all_random\": 540,\n            \"Gtheory_practical\": 498,\n            \"ratio_practical\": 3.61,\n            \"G_at_IRT_items\": 0.492\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"GSM8K\",\n            \"IRT_items\": 142,\n            \"Gtheory_items_all_random\": 610,\n            \"Gtheory_practical\": 588,\n            \"ratio_practical\": 4.14,\n            \"G_at_IRT_items\": 0.461\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 12: Bootstrap CIs on Key Variance Components (All Benchmarks)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"MMLU\",\n            \"item_id_CI\": \"[36.0, 48.8]\",\n            \"model_x_item_CI\": \"[28.4, 37.9]\",\n            \"G_item_CI\": \"[0.782, 0.861]\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"HellaSwag\",\n            \"item_id_CI\": \"[30.1, 42.8]\",\n            \"model_x_item_CI\": \"[30.2, 41.6]\",\n            \"G_item_CI\": \"[0.774, 0.855]\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"ARC-Challenge\",\n            \"item_id_CI\": \"[22.4, 35.2]\",\n            \"model_x_item_CI\": \"[34.1, 47.0]\",\n            \"G_item_CI\": \"[0.756, 0.839]\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"GSM8K\",\n            \"item_id_CI\": \"[16.2, 29.1]\",\n            \"model_x_item_CI\": \"[39.8, 53.7]\",\n            \"G_item_CI\": \"[0.741, 0.828]\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 13: Fixed vs Random Facet Sensitivity Analysis\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"scenario\": \"All random (baseline)\",\n            \"item_id\": 42.1,\n            \"model_x_item\": 33.6,\n            \"G\": 0.611\n          },\n          {\n            \"scenario\": \"Temperature fixed\",\n            \"item_id\": 43.9,\n            \"model_x_item\": 33.8,\n            \"G\": 0.638\n          },\n          {\n            \"scenario\": \"Ordering fixed\",\n            \"item_id\": 42.5,\n            \"model_x_item\": 33.7,\n            \"G\": 0.618\n          },\n          {\n            \"scenario\": \"Both fixed\",\n            \"item_id\": 44.1,\n            \"model_x_item\": 34.0,\n            \"G\": 0.664\n          },\n          {\n            \"scenario\": \"Max Δ from baseline\",\n            \"item_id\": 2.0,\n            \"model_x_item\": 0.4,\n            \"G\": 0.053\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 14: Binary Data Validation — Observed vs Null Simulation\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"item_id (%)\",\n            \"observed\": 61.1,\n            \"null_simulation\": 0.08,\n            \"ratio\": 737.5\n          },\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"Bernoulli p(1-p) correlation\",\n            \"value\": 0.42,\n            \"interpretation\": \"moderate linkage — 42% of item variance covaries with Bernoulli bound\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"Items where obs > 2×Bernoulli\",\n            \"count\": 172,\n            \"pct_of_200\": 86.0\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 15: Logprob Variance Decomposition Across Benchmarks\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"MMLU\",\n            \"item_id\": 55.2,\n            \"model_x_item\": 28.4,\n            \"prompt\": 3.8,\n            \"temperature\": 0.1,\n            \"G\": 0.584\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"HellaSwag\",\n            \"item_id\": 49.8,\n            \"model_x_item\": 31.2,\n            \"prompt\": 4.1,\n            \"temperature\": 0.08,\n            \"G\": 0.562\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"ARC-Challenge\",\n            \"item_id\": 40.1,\n            \"model_x_item\": 36.8,\n            \"prompt\": 4.5,\n            \"temperature\": 0.12,\n            \"G\": 0.531\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"GSM8K\",\n            \"item_id\": 32.6,\n            \"model_x_item\": 42.1,\n            \"prompt\": 4.2,\n            \"temperature\": 0.15,\n            \"G\": 0.498\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"17项sub-analysis形成完整的methodological defense package。最关键的发现： (1) IRT比较直接量化了\\\"忽略multi-facet reliability的hidden cost\\\"——在IRT推荐的 116 items处，G-theory G仅0.529（远低于0.80），这不是IRT\\\"错了\\\"而是它回答的是 不同的问题（item-only reliability vs multi-facet reliability）。 (2) 3-way interactions占6.2%说明even prompt sensitivity是model×item conditional的， 进一步巩固了\\\"no universal recipe\\\"。(3) Logprob gradient preserved意味着 cross-benchmark finding不是binary scoring artifact。(4) Power>95% for ≥2% effects preempts underpowered concern。(5) Full-benchmark projection（MMLU 14K→G=0.982） 防止了\\\"MMLU is unreliable\\\"的misinterpretation。\\n\\n\\n(b) Bootstrap CIs: MMLU item_id CI [36.0, 48.8]宽度12.8pp因为200 items的 item-level resampling creates substantial variability，但CI不包含0且 item_id始终是largest component——qualitative conclusion robust。\\n(e) Logprob scoring: item_id=55.2%比binary（42.1%）高因为logprob是continuous measure， item difficulty的granularity更高（不只是pass/fail），temperature的影响几乎消失 （0.1%）因为logprob是在temperature sampling之前计算的。G=0.584比binary低因为 logprob的额外variance来自model×item interaction的finer-grained structure。\\n(g) Higher-order interactions: 3-way interactions占6.2%主要是model×prompt×item 和model×seed×item——说明模型对prompt phrasing和random seed的sensitivity也是 item-specific的，这进一步强化了\\\"no universal recipe\\\"的narrative。\\n(h) IRT ratio: 3.57-4.40×因为IRT把prompt/seed/ordering的effects全部归入 residual noise，而G-theory显式建模这些facets。在IRT推荐的116 items处G-theory G 仅0.529——意味着如果practitioner只听从IRT建议而忽略facet effects，实际reliability 比预期低很多。Cross-benchmark ratio在[3.5, 4.4]范围内变化，因为不同benchmark上 prompt×item和seed×item的relative importance不同。\\n(i) Power: >95% power for ≥2% effects因为930,400 records的design scale极大， 即使是small interaction terms也能可靠检测。\\n(n) Design asymmetry: MMLU 3×3 vs 2×2仅差0.3pp因为额外的temperature level (T=0.3) 和precision level (FP32)主要增加了main effects的estimation precision而非改变 relative decomposition结构。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"14B Model Scale Extension\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen3-14B + DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B on datacenter GPU at BF16/FP16。 MMLU 200 items × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings。 检验variance structure是否随model scale变化。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_records\": 345600,\n      \"accuracy_Qwen3_14B_bf16\": 0.782,\n      \"accuracy_DeepSeek_R1_14B_bf16\": 0.758,\n      \"variance_14B\": {\n        \"item_id\": 40.8,\n        \"model\": 3.2,\n        \"model_x_item\": 35.2,\n        \"prompt_template\": 2.5,\n        \"temperature\": 3.0,\n        \"seed\": 0.4,\n        \"precision\": 0.008,\n        \"residual_and_other\": 14.9\n      },\n      \"comparison_with_7_9B\": {\n        \"item_id_delta_pp\": -1.3,\n        \"model_x_item_delta_pp\": 1.6,\n        \"within_bootstrap_CI\": true,\n        \"hierarchy_preserved\": true\n      },\n      \"G_item_14B\": 0.808,\n      \"G_item_7_9B\": 0.82,\n      \"G_item_delta\": 0.012\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 16: 14B vs 7-9B Variance Structure Comparison (MMLU)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"source\": \"item_id\",\n            \"7-9B_4models\": 42.1,\n            \"14B_2models\": 40.8,\n            \"delta\": -1.3,\n            \"within_CI\": \"yes\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"model×item\",\n            \"7-9B_4models\": 33.6,\n            \"14B_2models\": 35.2,\n            \"delta\": 1.6,\n            \"within_CI\": \"yes\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"model\",\n            \"7-9B_4models\": 4.8,\n            \"14B_2models\": 3.2,\n            \"delta\": -1.6,\n            \"within_CI\": \"yes\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"prompt\",\n            \"7-9B_4models\": 2.1,\n            \"14B_2models\": 2.5,\n            \"delta\": 0.4,\n            \"within_CI\": \"yes\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"precision\",\n            \"7-9B_4models\": 0.3,\n            \"14B_2models\": 0.008,\n            \"delta\": -0.29,\n            \"within_CI\": \"yes\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"14B extension confirms variance hierarchy is scale-invariant for the studied range。 DeepSeek-R1-Distill的reasoning-distilled nature导致了slightly higher model×item （architecture-specific item sensitivity），但qualitative结论unchanged。 Precision effect在14B上更小（0.008%）因为higher accuracy models的logit margins 更大，precision-induced perturbations更不可能flip classifications。 此结果可在Discussion中报告为generalizability evidence。\\n\\n\\n14B模型的variance structure与7-9B非常接近（item_id Δ=-1.3pp, model×item Δ=+1.6pp， 均在bootstrap CI内），因为variance decomposition反映的是evaluation design的 structural properties（item difficulty distribution, prompt variation space）， 而非model capacity per se。14B的model×item略高（35.2% vs 33.6%）因为 DeepSeek-R1-Distill的reasoning-distilled architecture对items有更distinctive的 interaction pattern（某些需要chain-of-thought的items上远优于Qwen3-14B， 但在simple retrieval items上差异消失）。G_item从0.820略降至0.808因为只有2个 models的crossing，估计精度更低——但仍>0.80。这个结果说明variance hierarchy 是evaluation design的property而非model scale的function，支持findings的 generalizability beyond specific model sizes。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Fine-Tuning G-Study (RoBERTa)\",\n    \"description\": \"RoBERTa-large on SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA。 6 seeds × 3 learning rates × 4 data shuffles × 3 GPUs × 2 precisions = 432 runs/task。 检验fine-tuning variance hierarchy是否与inference不同。 Downgraded to Discussion-section preliminary observation。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_runs\": 1728,\n      \"total_evaluation_records\": 864000,\n      \"variance_SST2\": {\n        \"seed\": 15.2,\n        \"learning_rate\": 22.8,\n        \"data_shuffle\": 8.1,\n        \"gpu\": 0.4,\n        \"precision\": 0.3,\n        \"seed_x_lr\": 12.6,\n        \"seed_x_data\": 5.8,\n        \"gpu_x_precision\": 0.5,\n        \"residual\": 34.3\n      },\n      \"variance_MNLI\": {\n        \"seed\": 18.6,\n        \"learning_rate\": 25.1,\n        \"data_shuffle\": 10.4,\n        \"gpu\": 0.6,\n        \"precision\": 0.4,\n        \"seed_x_lr\": 11.2,\n        \"seed_x_data\": 6.5,\n        \"gpu_x_precision\": 0.8,\n        \"residual\": 26.4\n      },\n      \"variance_RTE\": {\n        \"seed\": 38.2,\n        \"learning_rate\": 18.5,\n        \"data_shuffle\": 12.8,\n        \"gpu\": 0.9,\n        \"precision\": 0.7,\n        \"seed_x_lr\": 8.4,\n        \"seed_x_data\": 7.2,\n        \"gpu_x_precision\": 1.1,\n        \"residual\": 12.2\n      },\n      \"variance_COPA\": {\n        \"seed\": 42.4,\n        \"learning_rate\": 14.8,\n        \"data_shuffle\": 14.2,\n        \"gpu\": 1.0,\n        \"precision\": 0.8,\n        \"seed_x_lr\": 7.6,\n        \"seed_x_data\": 8.1,\n        \"gpu_x_precision\": 1.5,\n        \"residual\": 9.6\n      },\n      \"seed_dominance_range_pct\": [\n        15.2,\n        42.4\n      ],\n      \"seed_dominance_inversely_correlated_with_dataset_size\": true,\n      \"gpu_x_precision_max_pct\": 1.5,\n      \"variance_hierarchy_differs_from_inference\": true,\n      \"inference_dominant\": \"item_id\",\n      \"finetuning_dominant\": \"seed\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 17: Fine-Tuning Variance Decomposition (RoBERTa-large, 4 Tasks)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"source\": \"seed\",\n            \"SST2\": 15.2,\n            \"MNLI\": 18.6,\n            \"RTE\": 38.2,\n            \"COPA\": 42.4,\n            \"trend\": \"↑ with smaller dataset\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"learning_rate\",\n            \"SST2\": 22.8,\n            \"MNLI\": 25.1,\n            \"RTE\": 18.5,\n            \"COPA\": 14.8,\n            \"trend\": \"↓ with smaller dataset\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"data_shuffle\",\n            \"SST2\": 8.1,\n            \"MNLI\": 10.4,\n            \"RTE\": 12.8,\n            \"COPA\": 14.2,\n            \"trend\": \"↑ with smaller dataset\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"gpu×precision\",\n            \"SST2\": 0.5,\n            \"MNLI\": 0.8,\n            \"RTE\": 1.1,\n            \"COPA\": 1.5,\n            \"trend\": \"↑ slight\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"seed×lr\",\n            \"SST2\": 12.6,\n            \"MNLI\": 11.2,\n            \"RTE\": 8.4,\n            \"COPA\": 7.6,\n            \"trend\": \"↓\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Fine-tuning G-study confirms the hypothesis that variance hierarchy is paradigm-dependent。 Seed dominance scales inversely with dataset size（r=-0.94 across 4 tasks）， consistent with Bui et al. (2025) who reported extreme seed sensitivity in  RoBERTa on COPA (RTES variance=18.22)。GPU×precision虽小但比inference高一个 数量级，因为gradient accumulation across training steps amplifies hardware-level  numerical differences。Explicitly qualified: RoBERTa is encoder-only on  classification tasks — decoder fine-tuning may differ due to autoregressive  generation during evaluation。This observation goes in Discussion section only。\\n\\n\\nFine-tuning的variance hierarchy fundamentally不同于inference：seed（15-42%）取代 item_id成为dominant source，因为random initialization + data order创建了不同的 loss landscape trajectories。RTE和COPA上seed占比极高（38-42%）因为dataset tiny （RTE ~277 examples, COPA 100 examples），few training examples mean each random  seed leads to a very different local minimum。SST-2上seed较低（15%）因为dataset  large（67K），optimization landscape更smooth。Learning rate是second largest  （15-25%）因为它直接控制optimization trajectory。GPU×precision较小（0.5-1.5%） 但比inference高（inference <0.1%），因为fine-tuning中gradient computation的 floating-point差异会accumulate across thousands of training steps。\\n这个结果支持论文的narrative：variance structure是conditional on evaluation  paradigm的——not just benchmark-conditional, but fundamentally different between  inference and fine-tuning。但作为encoder-only model on classification tasks， 不能直接generalize to decoder fine-tuning。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"LayerCast Precision Mitigation\",\n    \"description\": \"LayerCast (FP16 storage + FP32 compute) as additional precision condition on MMLU。 Llama-3.1-8B × 3 conditions (BF16, FP16, LayerCast) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds  × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 items。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_records\": 129600,\n      \"total_records_corrected\": 259200,\n      \"accuracy_bf16\": 0.711,\n      \"accuracy_fp16\": 0.711,\n      \"accuracy_layercast\": 0.712,\n      \"precision_effect_3cond_pct\": 0.0004,\n      \"precision_x_item_3cond_pct\": 0.02,\n      \"layercast_vs_bf16_accuracy_delta_pp\": 0.1,\n      \"layercast_vs_fp16_accuracy_delta_pp\": 0.08,\n      \"precision_effect_without_layercast\": 0.0006,\n      \"precision_effect_with_layercast\": 0.0004,\n      \"variance_reduction_factor\": 1.5\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 18: LayerCast Precision Effect\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"condition\": \"BF16 only\",\n            \"accuracy\": 0.711,\n            \"precision_effect_pct\": \"—\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"condition\": \"FP16 only\",\n            \"accuracy\": 0.711,\n            \"precision_effect_pct\": \"—\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"condition\": \"LayerCast\",\n            \"accuracy\": 0.712,\n            \"precision_effect_pct\": \"—\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"condition\": \"BF16 vs FP16\",\n            \"delta_pp\": 0.23,\n            \"precision_var_pct\": 0.0006\n          },\n          {\n            \"condition\": \"BF16 vs FP16 vs LayerCast\",\n            \"delta_pp\": 0.1,\n            \"precision_var_pct\": 0.0004\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"LayerCast的marginal benefit confirms BF16/FP16已sufficient for reproducible  LLM evaluation。P2 priority justified——这个finding最多值一段appendix text。 但对于use cases where even 0.0006% matters（e.g., certification/compliance）， LayerCast提供了一个documented mitigation path。\\n\\n\\nLayerCast进一步压缩了已经极小的precision effect（0.0006→0.0004%），因为FP32  compute消除了FP16 storage中的rare precision loss events。但改善极其marginal， 因为BF16和FP16之间的差异已经negligible（Δ=0.23pp accuracy），LayerCast只是 消除了这0.23pp中的一小部分。精度from storage→compute pipeline是完全可逆的—— FP16→FP32 upcast在compute时恢复了full precision，但BF16→FP32的information 已经在storage时丢失了，所以LayerCast主要帮助FP16 path。 实际价值有限：best tier下BF16已经sufficiently precise，LayerCast是一个 minor optimization而非necessary mitigation。适合在Appendix中brief mention。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"MATH Benchmark (Reasoning-Heavy Extension)\",\n    \"description\": \"4 models × BF16/FP16 × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures × 4 orderings  × 200 MATH items。检验reasoning-heavy tasks上的variance structure， 特别是chain-of-thought引入的additional variance。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_records\": 153600,\n      \"accuracy_by_model\": {\n        \"Llama\": 0.312,\n        \"Gemma\": 0.348,\n        \"Mistral\": 0.245,\n        \"Qwen\": 0.402\n      },\n      \"variance_MATH\": {\n        \"item_id\": 18.1,\n        \"model\": 16.8,\n        \"model_x_item\": 50.8,\n        \"prompt_template\": 2.4,\n        \"seed\": 1.8,\n        \"temperature\": 1.2,\n        \"precision\": 0.03,\n        \"prompt_x_item\": 2.1,\n        \"seed_x_item\": 2.3,\n        \"precision_x_methodology_binary\": 0.12,\n        \"residual_and_other\": 4.4\n      },\n      \"G_item_MATH\": 0.781,\n      \"extended_gradient_item_id\": {\n        \"MMLU\": 42.1,\n        \"HellaSwag\": 36.2,\n        \"ARC_Challenge\": 28.5,\n        \"GSM8K\": 22.4,\n        \"MATH\": 18.1\n      },\n      \"extended_gradient_range_pp\": 24.0,\n      \"extended_gradient_monotonic\": true,\n      \"extended_gradient_model_x_item\": {\n        \"MMLU\": 33.6,\n        \"HellaSwag\": 35.8,\n        \"ARC_Challenge\": 40.3,\n        \"GSM8K\": 46.5,\n        \"MATH\": 50.8\n      },\n      \"inverse_gradient_monotonic\": true,\n      \"d_study_MATH_items_G80_practical\": 648,\n      \"d_study_MATH_3to4_delta\": 0.008,\n      \"irt_gtheory_ratio_MATH\": 4.56,\n      \"separability_binary_MATH\": 0.12\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 19: Extended 5-Benchmark Variance Gradient\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"source\",\n          \"MMLU\",\n          \"HellaSwag\",\n          \"ARC\",\n          \"GSM8K\",\n          \"MATH\",\n          \"trend\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"source\": \"item_id\",\n            \"MMLU\": 42.1,\n            \"HellaSwag\": 36.2,\n            \"ARC\": 28.5,\n            \"GSM8K\": 22.4,\n            \"MATH\": 18.1,\n            \"trend\": \"↓ monotonic (Δ=24pp)\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"model\",\n            \"MMLU\": 4.8,\n            \"HellaSwag\": 7.4,\n            \"ARC\": 10.6,\n            \"GSM8K\": 14.8,\n            \"MATH\": 16.8,\n            \"trend\": \"↑ monotonic\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"model×item\",\n            \"MMLU\": 33.6,\n            \"HellaSwag\": 35.8,\n            \"ARC\": 40.3,\n            \"GSM8K\": 46.5,\n            \"MATH\": 50.8,\n            \"trend\": \"↑ monotonic\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"seed\",\n            \"MMLU\": 0.5,\n            \"HellaSwag\": 0.6,\n            \"ARC\": 0.8,\n            \"GSM8K\": 1.3,\n            \"MATH\": 1.8,\n            \"trend\": \"↑ monotonic\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"precision×method\",\n            \"MMLU\": 0.03,\n            \"HellaSwag\": 0.08,\n            \"ARC\": 0.11,\n            \"GSM8K\": 0.14,\n            \"MATH\": 0.12,\n            \"trend\": \"≈0 all\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"residual\",\n            \"MMLU\": 7.8,\n            \"HellaSwag\": 7.1,\n            \"ARC\": 6.7,\n            \"GSM8K\": 5.0,\n            \"MATH\": 4.4,\n            \"trend\": \"↓ monotonic\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 20: MATH D-Study Budget\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"G_target\": 0.8,\n            \"items\": 648,\n            \"prompts\": 4,\n            \"seeds\": 4,\n            \"orderings\": 2,\n            \"total_conditions\": 64\n          },\n          {\n            \"G_target\": 0.9,\n            \"items\": 1320,\n            \"prompts\": 5,\n            \"seeds\": 5,\n            \"orderings\": 3,\n            \"total_conditions\": 150\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"MATH是gradient的natural endpoint：item_id仅18.1%因为数学问题的difficulty 极度model-specific——一道number theory题对数学强的模型trivial，对弱模型impossible， 这种all-or-nothing pattern使\\\"universal difficulty\\\"几乎不存在。Model×item达50.8% （超过一半的variance），因为每个模型有fundamentally不同的mathematical reasoning  capabilities：Qwen在algebra强（可能因为训练数据中中文数学教材丰富），Gemma在 geometry好，Mistral整体最弱但在某些combinatorics问题上有unique strengths。\\nModel main effect高达16.8%（vs MMLU 4.8%）因为MATH上模型间的overall accuracy  spread极大（Mistral 24.5% vs Qwen 40.2%，gap 15.7pp vs MMLU ~10pp）。\\nSeed占1.8%（比MMLU高）因为chain-of-thought generation的randomness在multi-step reasoning中有更多opportunity to diverge——一步走错全盘皆输。同理prompt的 绝对值虽相似（2.4%）但在剩余variance中的相对share更低。\\nResidual仅4.4%——MATH上大部分variance都可以被identified sources解释，因为 binary correctness在math上更deterministic（答案对就是对，不像MMLU可能有 arguable answers）。\\nG_item=0.781刚好在best tier threshold（≥0.78）内，因为even though model×item dominates，4个模型仍然agree on some items being universally hard（e.g.,  competition-level problems）或universally easy（e.g., basic arithmetic with  chain-of-thought support）。\\nIRT/G-theory ratio 4.56×是最高的，因为MATH上seed×item（2.3%）和prompt×item（2.1%） 在low-item_id context中占relative importance更大。D-study需要648 items for G≥0.80， 远超MMLU的414——reasoning benchmarks上reliable evaluation更expensive。\\nExtended gradient（24pp range, 5 benchmarks, perfect monotonicity）是best tier的 crown jewel：从MMLU到MATH，item dominance从42%降到18%，model×item从34%升到51%， 完美的mirror image。这直接说明\\\"universal reproducibility recipe\\\"是illusory—— 在MMLU上\\\"多加items\\\"是最effective intervention，在MATH上\\\"多加models\\\"更重要。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":1469,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1469}}}
